#: chairemi_chair/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "CHAIR"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_sleep/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "<w>Zzzzzzzzzz.....</w>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_sleep/11
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hmm... wzhat..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_sleep/22
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Your order's ready Mr Davenport..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_sleep/33
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Curtain rises at six pms."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_sleep/44
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "<w>zzzzzzzzzzzzzz</w>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_wrong_time/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Ooh, coming, coming!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_wrong_time/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hello, hello! Sorry for any confusion."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_wrong_time/19
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I'm currently working my day job at all five restaurants and bars in the house. It's hard being an actor!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_wrong_time/27/b/1
msgctxt "Daisuke"
msgid "Chairemi, two-top just walked in!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_wrong_time/30/b/1
msgctxt "Freddy"
msgid "Chairemi, the cones are starting to melt!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_wrong_time/33/b/1 chairemi_chair/chairemi_wrong_time/36/b/1
msgctxt "Eddie"
msgid "Chairemi, I'm getting a little overwhelmed over here!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_wrong_time/39/b/1
msgctxt "Koa"
msgid "Chairemi, I'm thinking I need to take five for a second, can you cover for me?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_wrong_time/42/b/1
msgctxt "Beverly"
msgid "Chairemi, this ice isn't gonna cube itself!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_wrong_time/45
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Coming!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_wrong_time/56
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Stop by for another night of some theater!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/not_performing_tonight/0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(Oh. Hi.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/not_performing_tonight/0/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(I'm on vocal rest right now so I'm not too tired for the work week.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/not_performing_tonight/0/16
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(Er, <i>trying my best</i> to rest, anyways.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/not_performing_tonight/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Okay, see ya!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/not_performing_tonight/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>I'll have to catch you next time then...</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/not_performing_tonight/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(Uh, you're welcome to swing by the show another night. If you like!)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/2/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Mi-mi-mi-mi-miiiiii~! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/3/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Left at the altar... It's too horrible for words!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/4/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "CALIBRATING. INCOMING METEOR. READJUSTING SHIP COURSE TO AVOID IMPACT. BEEP."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/4/b/9
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "NEW DATA ADDED. IT APPEARS WE ARE BEING WATCHED."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/5/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "And there, in the deepest recesses of the fae wilds... THAT is where I shall find... the Everblade!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/6/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Dearie me... Where, oh where has my poor husband gone to...?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/9
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The petite blonde thespian turns her attention to you suddenly, greeting you with a cheerful smile."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/17
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hey there! I didn’t realize I had an audience!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/28
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "A-he-hem~!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/36
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She draws a hand over her face, perhaps to help her concentrate. And then..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/44/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh, Henry! What happened to you?! I'm so worried... The only trace is the bloodstain on the window!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/45/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "La la la Laaaaaaa~! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/46/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "If I can't find a husband soon, I shall be forced to wed the dreadful Count Lionel! Oh, horror of horrors!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/47/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "TILT THE SHIP TO PORT, CAPTAIN. IF WE ARE NOT CAREFUL, WE WILL BE SUCKED INTO THAT BLACK HOLE."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/48/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hail, fair traveler. Have you seen a sword in these woods? A sword that sparkles with the light of the evening sun, even in the darkest of nights?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What are you doing?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/7/b/1 chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/8/b/1 chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/9/b/1 chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/10/b/1 chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/11/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Acting, of course!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/7/b/9
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I put on a different play each day of the week! Tonight is SATURDAY NIGHT DEAD."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/7/b/17
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "The play of the day is <i>\"Throw it All Away\"</i> and I’m playing a woman whose husband has mysteriously disappeared."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/7/b/25 chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/8/b/25 chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/9/b/25 chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/10/b/33 chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/11/b/25
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hey... You wouldn’t be interested in joining me up here, would you?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/8/b/9
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I put on a different play each day of the week! Today is TUESICAL, THE TUESDAY MUSICAL!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/8/b/17
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "The play of the day is <i>\"Pleathers\"</i>. It's a dark comedy set in a high school."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/9/b/9
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I put on a different play each day of the week! Today is WEDDING WEDNESDAY, home of our melodramatic love stories."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/9/b/17
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "The play of the day is <i>\"Marquis? More Kiss!\"</i>. I’m playing the role of Esther Chairabelle, a debutant trying to marry her beloved Marquis."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/10/b/9
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I put on a different play each day of the week! Today is SCI-FI THURSDAY."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/10/b/17
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "The play of the day is <i>\"Beyond the Starscape\"</i>. I am playing the role of the... NAVIGATOR ROBOT."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/10/b/25
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "BEEP BOOP."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/11/b/9
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I put on a different play each day of the week! Today is FANTASY FRIDAY."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/11/b/17
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "The play of the day is <i>\"Everblade\"</i>. I’m playing Spindle, a forest spirit trying to save her home by finding a magic sword."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/14/0/s/0 chairemi_chair/chairemi_2ndPlay/0/8/7/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/14/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe some other time."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/14/c-1/11/b/1 chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/14/c-1/12/b/1 chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/14/c-1/13/b/1 chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/14/c-1/14/b/1 chairemi_chair/chairemi_firstencounter/0/c-0/14/c-1/15/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aww. Okay, next time then! Don't be a stranger!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart1/0/0/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "This mystery is just too much for an old biddy like me to solve alone... Would you help a poor old woman solve a crime? Just this once?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart1/0/1/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ Greetings fair trav'ler who deigned to engage. ♪ / ♪ Would you perchance like to join me on stage? ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart1/0/2/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh dear... I'm simply at a loss! My heart has shattered into pieces... If only SOMEONE would... come up on stage and be my scene partner?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart1/0/3/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "GREETINGS, SPACE-FRIEND. HUMAN VOICE ACTIVATE: Bzzt... Ch-chkk!! Did you change your mind about joining me on stage?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart1/0/4/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hail, fellow traveler! Hast thou changed thy mind about joining me up on stage?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart1/0/7/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Alright, let's do it."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart1/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nah, sorry."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart1/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Yaaayyyy, that's the spirit!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart1/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aw. Well, I'll be here! ACTING!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart2/0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Great! Can’t wait to see what you can do."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart2/0/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I’m sure you’ll break a leg! ...but don’t break too many. I only have four of them."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart2/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So... where's the script?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart2/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "How do we start?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh. There is no script."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart2/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "We each pick stock roles and then improvise our way through a little sketch. The genre is our guide!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart2/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "We’re very <i>commedia dell'arte</i> here."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart2/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I’ll give you a character, and you can direct the story from there."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart2/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This seems kind of hard."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart2/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "First time for everything, I guess."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart2/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aw, don’t worry! It’s no big deal. We’re just playing! There are no stakes at all. We usually don't even have an audience. The important thing is that you have fun!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart2/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh, and that you’re comfortable!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart2/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I’m big on the actors being comfortable in their space. So we shouldn't do anything <i>too</i> intense before we get comfortable performing with one another. That means no roughhousing and no... uh..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart2/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "For lack of a better word, no being a creep. Heh, heh, heh, heh.\t Haha."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart2/0/g-1/35
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "So as long as you follow that rule, I'll play along with anything you say and do. Promise, there's no wrong answers."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart2/0/g-1/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay, I'll do my best."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart2/0/g-1/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm nervous..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart2/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "That’s the spirit!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart2/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Don't worry! I've got your back. I'm built for support. Specifically the lumbar variety."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart2/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "And remember, if it ever gets too much for you or if you're uncomfortable with the subject matter, you just let me know."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart2/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Let’s pick a safe word! You say the word, and we’ll stop whatever we’re doing. Okay?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart2/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "My word is \"Davenport\". If I say \"Davenport\", it means we stop what we're doing."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart2/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Go ahead and pick your safe word!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart3/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "\"Didgeridoo.\""
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart3/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "\"Bison.\""
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart3/0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "\"Davenport.\""
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart3/0/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "\"Chairsex.\""
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart3/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "That's a fun one! \"Didgeridoo\"... \"Didgeridoo\", \"didgeridooooo\"... Okay! Got it!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart3/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Ooh, okay! \"Bison\"! \"Byyyyye-son\". Bison, bison, bison. Got it!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart3/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh, my word? You wanna be a matching set, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart3/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Well, it'll be easy to remember. Sure! Davenport for both of us."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart3/0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "...ooookay."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart3/0/c-3/24
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "That's... kinda funny."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart3/0/c-3/32
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "But this is a tool to help the performers feel comfortable around each other. So maybe you should pick something less... Less <i>that</i>."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart4/0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Great!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart4/0/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Let me introduce you to today's audience."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart4/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't know there'd be an audience..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart4/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hello, audience!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart4/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Haha, don't be nervous. Our viewers are the best! Big supporters of the arts."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayPart4/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hello, audience!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_fc_sorter/10
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "All right! We should be ready to go then. Remember, be respectful, and have fun!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_fc_sorter/18
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Let's get started!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_fc_sorter/0/b/1
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "...hello."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_fc_sorter/1/b/1 chairemi_chair/florence_wednesday_unawakened/0/3
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Hello."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_fc_sorter/8/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aren't you lucky? Mayor Celia the Ceiling is in attendance for your very first performance!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_fc_sorter/9/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aren't you lucky? Mayor Celia the Ceiling is in attendance!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_fc_sorter/15/b/1
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Yes. Lucky, lucky us."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_fc_sorter/15/b/9
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hm? Do... you two know each other?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_fc_sorter/15/b/17
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "You could say that."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_fc_sorter/15/b/25
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "...hopefully you're a better actor than an investigator."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_fc_sorter/15/b/33 chairemi_chair/wednesday_fc_sorter/8/b/39
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Wow."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_fc_sorter/15/b/41 chairemi_chair/wednesday_fc_sorter/8/b/47
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Such awkwardness. Such tension!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_fc_sorter/15/b/52
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Let's channel that energy into something really great. All right, everyone?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_fc_sorter/17/b/1 chairemi_chair/tuethur_else/0/6
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Oh come now, Chairemi, don't scare them off."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_fc_sorter/17/b/9/b/1 chairemi_chair/tuethur_fc_sorter/17/b/10/b/1
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "We're actually quite close."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_fc_sorter/17/b/11/b/1
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "We've actually already met."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_fc_sorter/17/b/14
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh, really? Well, who would've guessed that our new scene partner had friends in such... high places!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_fc_sorter/17/b/25
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "<i>Literally!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_fc_sorter/17/b/33
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Har har."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_fc_sorter/17/b/41
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Never heard that one before."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_fc_sorter/8/b/15
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "...erm. H-Hello."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_fc_sorter/8/b/23
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "We meet again, citizen."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_fc_sorter/8/b/31
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Hopefully you're a better actor than an investigator."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_fc_sorter/8/b/58
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Let's channel that energy into something really great, alright everyone?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_fc_sorter/13/b/12 chairemi_chair/frisat_fc_sorter/3
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh, gee. Wasn't expecting the spotlight to be on <i>me</i> today!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/frisat_fc_sorter/22/b/1 chairemi_chair/frisat_fc_sorter_friend/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Florence is co-mayor with Mayor Celia, the ceiling!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/frisat_fc_sorter/22/b/9
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Ho ho! Oh, I think our human knows that very well."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/frisat_fc_sorter/22/b/17
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Er! <i>The</i> human, I mean!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/frisat_fc_sorter/22/b/25
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "N-Not implying the three of us have anything going on on the side."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/frisat_fc_sorter/22/b/36
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Er... I mean..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/frisat_fc_sorter/22/b/44
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Haha! No offence, Florence, but with that poker face? I don't think I'd recommend an acting career!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/frisat_fc_sorter/22/b/52
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Well, that's why I come here, isn't it? To watch you all do it!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/frisat_fc_sorter/22/b/60
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "What a delightful surprise to see you here, though! This is going to be a great show!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/frisat_fc_sorter/22/b/68
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Let's not waste any more time then!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/frisat_fc_sorter/24/b/1
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Yes, we've, erm... met!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/frisat_fc_sorter/24/b/9
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "H-Hello..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/frisat_fc_sorter/24/b/25
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Well, if introductions are out of the way, let's get started with the show!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/frisat_fc_sorter/25/b/4
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Florence is the personal assistant to Mayor Celia herself!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/frisat_fc_sorter/25/b/15
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh, don't you go bigging me up now."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/frisat_fc_sorter/25/b/26
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "I'm nobody special, just focus on your performance! And know I'll be cheering you on!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/frisat_fc_sorter/25/b/37
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Alright, in that case, let's start!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/frisat_fc_sorter_friend/0 chairemi_chair/wednesday_junkdrawer/0/33
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Hello!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/frisat_fc_sorter_friend/16/b/1
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh, she knows all that already!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/frisat_fc_sorter_friend/17/b/1
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh, he knows all that already!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/frisat_fc_sorter_friend/18/b/1
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh, they know all that already!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/frisat_fc_sorter_friend/21
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Lovely to see you again, dear!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/frisat_fc_sorter_friend/29
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "But enough focus on me. G'wan, start the show!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/frisat_fc_sorter_friend/37
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "As you wish!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethurstella_convo/0/3 chairemi_chair/wednesday_stella/0/3
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Hello again."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethurstella_convo/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Celia? I thought I was supposed to be meeting you at the stairs."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethurstella_convo/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Yes, you certainly were."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethurstella_convo/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "I waited, but you did not arrive. And unfortunately, the time for Chairemi's play came around."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethurstella_convo/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "I'm always here at this time, and unlike some others I am a ceiling who keeps my appointments."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethurstella_convo/0/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yipes!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethurstella_convo/0/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Supporting the arts is more important than silly civic matters!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethurstella_convo/0/c-0/31/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I have trouble keeping track of what the hell is going on here."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethurstella_convo/0/c-0/31/c-0/7 chairemi_chair/tuethurstella_convo/0/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Whoa. Such intensity!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethurstella_convo/0/c-0/31/c-0/15 chairemi_chair/tuethurstella_convo/0/c-0/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Let's channel that into a really great performance, alright everyone?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_else/0/14 chairemi_chair/wednesday_junkdrawer/0/68 chairemi_chair/florence_wednesday_unawakened/0/c-0/64
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Besides, I'm the ceiling. Strictly speaking, I'm always watching them. Whether they're on stage or not."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_else/0/22/s/0 chairemi_chair/wednesday_junkdrawer/0/76/s/0 chairemi_chair/florence_wednesday_unawakened/0/c-0/72/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's pretty creepy."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_else/0/23/s/0 chairemi_chair/wednesday_junkdrawer/0/77/s/0 chairemi_chair/florence_wednesday_unawakened/0/c-0/72/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's kind of comforting, in a weird way."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_else/0/c-0/7 chairemi_chair/wednesday_junkdrawer/0/c-0/7 chairemi_chair/florence_wednesday_unawakened/0/c-0/72/c-0/7
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Maybe. But if it weren't for me you'd be dealing with dangling wires and rats overhead."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_else/0/c-0/15/0/s/0 chairemi_chair/wednesday_junkdrawer/0/c-0/15/0/s/0 chairemi_chair/florence_wednesday_unawakened/0/c-0/72/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait. Rats?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_else/0/c-0/15/c-0/7 chairemi_chair/wednesday_junkdrawer/0/c-0/15/c-0/7 chairemi_chair/florence_wednesday_unawakened/0/c-0/72/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Vaughn Trapp is on it."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_else/0/c-0/15/c-0/18 chairemi_chair/wednesday_junkdrawer/0/c-0/15/c-0/18 chairemi_chair/florence_wednesday_unawakened/0/c-0/72/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Or so he tells me."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_else/0/c-0/15/c-0/29 chairemi_chair/wednesday_junkdrawer/0/c-0/15/c-0/29
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "I haven't... heard from him in a while."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_else/0/c-0/15/c-0/37
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Well, let's not keep our audience waiting any longer, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_else/0/c-1/13 chairemi_chair/wednesday_junkdrawer/0/c-1/13 chairemi_chair/florence_wednesday_unawakened/0/c-0/72/c-1/13
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "I'm glad you think so. Nice to see somebody appreciating all my hard work."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_else/0/c-1/21 chairemi_chair/wednesday_junkdrawer/0/c-1/21 chairemi_chair/florence_wednesday_unawakened/0/c-0/72/c-1/21
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "And I'm excited to see some new blood on stage for a change."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_else/0/c-1/29 chairemi_chair/wednesday_junkdrawer/0/c-1/29 chairemi_chair/florence_wednesday_unawakened/0/c-0/72/c-1/29
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aw, Celia... You don't like my one-object showcase?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_else/0/c-1/37 chairemi_chair/wednesday_junkdrawer/0/c-1/37 chairemi_chair/florence_wednesday_unawakened/0/c-0/72/c-1/37
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "You're a unique talent, my dear. But you can't deny that it's a bit of a relief to see someone besides myself taking interest in the arts."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_else/0/c-1/45 chairemi_chair/wednesday_junkdrawer/0/c-1/45 chairemi_chair/florence_wednesday_unawakened/0/c-0/72/c-1/45
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "That's true!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuethur_else/0/c-1/53
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Well, let's not keep you waiting any longer, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_love/0/3
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh!!! Hello, dear!!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_love/0/14
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Haha. My. What a pleasant surprise."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_love/0/22/s/0 chairemi_chair/wednesday_friend/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey! What are you two doing here?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_love/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "We always make time to see the Wedding Wednesday performance. But to think our own love story's happy ending would walk out on stage..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_love/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Careful, Chairemi, your play has some stiff competition this week."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_love/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Whoa. Didn't realize you all were a three-legged tryst! Crazy coincidence!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_love/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "We'll have to make this play extra good then, 'ey partner?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_friend/0/3
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh! Hello, dearie!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_friend/0/14
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "My, what a pleasant surprise."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_friend/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "We always make time to see the Wedding Wednesday performance. But to think the catalyst for our own love story would walk out on stage..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_friend/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Are you often typecast as a matchmaker, darling?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_friend/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hey, you didn't tell me you were experienced! You've been holding out on me."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_friend/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Well, that just means my expectations are even higher than before! Let's get started!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_stella/0/14
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Hi!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_stella/0/22/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Celia? I thought I was supposed to be meeting you at the stairs—"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_stella/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hi you two. What are you doing here?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_stella/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Hush now!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_stella/0/c-0/29
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Yes, we had an arranged meeting, it's true."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_stella/0/c-0/37
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "But Florence and I never miss the Wedding Wednesday performance."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_stella/0/c-0/45 chairemi_chair/wednesday_stella/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh, it's our absolute favorite!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_stella/0/c-0/53 chairemi_chair/wednesday_stella/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I see we all know each other! That's great!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_stella/0/c-0/61 chairemi_chair/wednesday_stella/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "No nerves when performing in front of friends!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_stella/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Well, I may be busy. But Florence and I never miss the Wedding Wednesday performance."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_junkdrawer/0/6
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Ah, yes, I remember you. You're the one who was working on the junk drawer issue."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_junkdrawer/0/14
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "I didn't know you were a thespian. What a pleasant surprise."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_junkdrawer/0/22
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "This is my assistant, Florence."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_junkdrawer/0/41 chairemi_chair/florence_wednesday_unawakened/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "And look at this! Your first performance and you've got two VIPs in the front row!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_junkdrawer/0/52
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Well, I'd hardly call myself a VIP..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_junkdrawer/0/60
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Come now, Chairemi, don't scare them off. We want <i>more</i> citizens involved in the arts, not less."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_junkdrawer/0/c-0/15/c-0/37 chairemi_chair/wednesday_junkdrawer/0/c-1/53 chairemi_chair/florence_wednesday_unawakened/0/c-0/72/c-0/15/c-0/26 chairemi_chair/florence_wednesday_unawakened/0/c-0/72/c-1/53
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Well, let's not keep our esteemed guests waiting any longer, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/florence_wednesday_unawakened/0/11
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aren't we lucky? Look at that! A full house!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/florence_wednesday_unawakened/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "An audience of two is a \"full house\"?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/florence_wednesday_unawakened/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Well, sure."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/florence_wednesday_unawakened/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "We've got, like, over a hundred of us under one roof, so technically the house is always full. I take what I can get for advertising purposes."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/florence_wednesday_unawakened/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Meet Mayor Celia the Ceiling and her lovely assistant, Florence Floor."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/florence_wednesday_unawakened/0/c-0/48
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "\"Lovely assistant\"... oh, golly. Chairemi, you are too much!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/florence_wednesday_unawakened/0/c-0/56
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Come now, Chairemi, don't scare them off. We want <i>more</i> people involved in the arts, not fewer."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayWrapUp/1/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Wow. You did great! You're a natural."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayWrapUp/1/b/9
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Be sure to come back on another day if you want to try out another play! Hope to see you again!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_1stPlayWrapUp/1/b/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Chairemi bows gracefully."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/heywrap/0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hey."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/heywrap/0/8/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Uh. Not bad for your first time."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/heywrap/0/11
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I know it can be a little overwhelming when you're in the thick of it, but... try to keep everyone's boundaries in mind, okay?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/heywrap/0/22
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "It's no fun for anyone if the performers can't trust one another."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/heywrap/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry, I'm just new at this."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/heywrap/0/31/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Trust shmust I always say."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/heywrap/0/c-0/7 chairemi_chair/heywrap/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "So long as you promise to do your best, you're welcome to come back. Remember that every day is a different genre, so if today wasn't really your scene, there's always something else tomorrow!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_2ndPlay/0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Welcome back!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_2ndPlay/0/8/0/b/1 chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay/0/8/0/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "It's SATURDAY NIGHT DEAD. Tonight's play is called <i>\"Throw it All Away\"</i>. It's a mystery, obviously. Care to join me?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_2ndPlay/0/8/1/b/1 chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay/0/8/1/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Today is TUESICAL, THE TUESDAY MUSICAL. Our play is called <i>\"Pleathers\"</i>. It's a musical! Care to join me?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_2ndPlay/0/8/2/b/1 chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay/0/8/2/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Today is WEDDING WEDNESDAY. Our play is a romance called <i>\"Marquis? More Kiss!\"</i> Care to join me?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_2ndPlay/0/8/3/b/1 chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay/0/8/3/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "It's SCI-FI THURSDAY. Today's play is called <i>\"Beyond the Starscape\"</i>. It's about space exploration. Care to join me?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_2ndPlay/0/8/4/b/1 chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay/0/8/4/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "It's FANTASY FRIDAY. Today's play is called <i>\"Everblade\"</i>. There's a lot of magic in this one! Care to join me?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_2ndPlay/0/8/8/s/0 chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay/0/8/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What plays do you do each day again?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_2ndPlay/0/8/9/s/0 chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay/0/8/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not this time."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_2ndPlay/0/8/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Awesome!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_2ndPlay/0/8/c-2/7 chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay/0/8/c-2/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aww, alright."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_2ndPlay/0/8/c-2/15 chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay/0/8/c-2/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Remember that we do a different genre every day of the week! I hope you'll come back for one of them!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_2ndPlayWrapUp/0/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Well... Um... Our performances haven't always been perfect. But it's not about perfect! It's about fun."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_2ndPlayWrapUp/0/b/9
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "As long as you promise to do your best, you're welcome to come back. Remember that every day is a different genre, so if today wasn't really your scene, there's always something else tomorrow!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_2ndPlayWrapUp/1/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Fantastic work as always!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_2ndPlayWrapUp/1/b/12
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Come back on another day if you want to try out another play. Or even today if you want!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_2ndPlayWrapUp/1/b/20
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "You're so much fun to play off of. I'm really looking forward to it."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_2ndPlayWrapUp/1/b/28
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Chairemi gives a delightful little curtsy."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_playschedule/0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Tuesdays are musicals. Wednesdays are romantic dramas. Thursday is sci-fi, Friday is high fantasy, and Saturdays are murder mysteries!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_playschedule/0/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "And remember, I'm working my day jobs during the daylight hours to support my passion."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_playschedule/0/16
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "So come by at night for some theater!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_playschedule/0/24
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "6pm sharp - otherwise I might be sleeeeeepiiing."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_playschedule/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Got it!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_playschedule/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll do my best..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay/0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hey! If it isn't my favorite scene partner!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay/0/8/7/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay/0/8/c-0/8/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlayGreenlight/0/4
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Heck yeah, friend!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlayGreenlight/0/12
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "...um. Hey. Just so you know... I think I've gotten used to playing off of you by now."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlayGreenlight/0/20
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "If you wanted to try something a little more... I dunno, intense? Well, I-I-I wouldn't say no! I-I-I'm down for whatever!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlayGreenlight/0/31
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Doors are open for... dalliances."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlayGreenlight/0/39
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Just thought I'd say that up front."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlayGreenlight/0/47
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Okay, sorry! Kinda weird to pause like that."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlayGreenlight/0/55/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's not weird. I'm glad you told me."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlayGreenlight/0/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay... I'll keep that in mind!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlayGreenlight/0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So things can get <i>saucy</i>, huh? Excellent..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlayGreenlight/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aww. You're so sweet."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_aggressive/0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Haha, wow! You really committed."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_aggressive/0/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "And, um..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_aggressive/0/16
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "If I'm being honest... I didn't mind getting a little physical with you there. I was kind of hoping you would, actually!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_aggressive/0/24
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hope that's not too weird or anything."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_aggressive/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't worry. I liked it too. I like performing with you... even physically when it's appropriate."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_aggressive/0/33/s/0 chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_spicy/0/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It was a little much for me to be honest."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_aggressive/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aah! I was hoping you'd say that!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_aggressive/0/c-0/18 chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_spicy/0/c-0/31/c-0/18
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I've never had this much fun with a scene partner before!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_aggressive/0/c-0/26 chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_spicy/0/c-0/31/c-0/26
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Communication is so important to me, and we're so in-sync, y'know? Like I feel like I can adjust myself any which way you want to lean."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_aggressive/0/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is there anything you’d like me to do for you??"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_aggressive/0/c-0/34/c-0/7 chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_spicy/0/c-0/31/c-0/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "O-Oh! Uh!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_aggressive/0/c-0/34/c-0/15 chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_spicy/0/c-0/31/c-0/34/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Well, um... If it's not too much trouble..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_aggressive/0/c-0/34/c-0/26 chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_spicy/0/c-0/31/c-0/34/c-0/26
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Could you maybe... sit on my face a little?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_aggressive/0/c-0/34/c-0/34 chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_spicy/0/c-0/31/c-0/34/c-0/34
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Chairemi covers her face with her hands, blushing fiercely."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_aggressive/0/c-0/34/c-0/42
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aaaah! I can't believe I just said that!!! I'M A CHAIR!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_aggressive/0/c-1/7 chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_spicy/0/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aww."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_aggressive/0/c-1/15 chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_spicy/0/c-0/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I won't lie, that's a little disappointing."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_aggressive/0/c-1/23 chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_spicy/0/c-0/31/c-1/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "But hey, I'm cool keeping a reasonable distance! And I'm really happy you're comfortable enough to be honest with me."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_aggressive/0/c-1/31 chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_spicy/0/c-0/31/c-1/31
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Performing with you has been really fun. I hope we can do it again some time!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_spicy/0/6
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "...things got a little intimate at the end there, didn't they?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_spicy/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You said you were open to trying something more intense."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_spicy/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh, don't worry! I'm not mad! I actually really liked it."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_spicy/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "It was... kind of fun to lose myself in the character and commit."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_spicy/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "...did you like it?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_spicy/0/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah. I liked it a lot, actually."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_spicy/0/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aah! I was hoping you'd say that!!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_spicy/0/c-0/31/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Communication <i>is</i> important. So... While we're being honest with each other. Is there anything you’d like me to do for you??"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_spicy/0/c-0/31/c-0/34/c-0/42
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aaaah! I can't believe I just said that! I-I'm a chair!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_friendship/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Phew! Great work!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_friendship/14
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I haven't had a scene partner this fun to play off of since the time I got paired with that technicolor chair at the kids' table during the last family reunion."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_friendship/22
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Thanks for this. I feel like you and I can really trust each other. Like... if you fell backwards, I'd always have your back! That is my job, after all!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_3rdPlay_friendship/33
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Come back any time. I can't wait to work with you again!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play/0/12
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Here we go! Murder mystery!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play/0/20
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(Florence is a big fan of these. She's here every Saturday.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play/0/31
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "It's true, I'm just an absolute sucker for crime shows!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play/0/39
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Sometimes I picture myself pulling off that devilish \"body outline in chalk\" floor look."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play/0/50
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Is that weird?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play/0/61
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Okay, partner. Listen up."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play/0/69
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I'll be playing the part of a poor old rocking chair whose husband has gone missing. You're the detective investigating the disappearance."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play/0/77
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I'll play along with whatever direction you decide to take the story. Just remember, keep it respectful and fun."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play/0/85 chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/68
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "And... lights up!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play/0/108
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Chairemi clasps her hands together, becoming a new chair altogether in the blink of an eye."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play/0/119 chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A1/0/c-0/63
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Woo! Woo! Yes!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play/0/133
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh... dearie me, Detective. Is there any news about my husband, Henry David Throw, the throw pillow? He's been missing for nearly four days and I'm worried sick!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play/0/144/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry, ma'am. No news so far."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play/0/145/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "As it turns out, we just found him!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A/0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A/0/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "It's so quiet here without him. I haven't been able to sleep a wink!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A/0/16
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Detective... please, let me join the investigation! You have to! You just have to! I'm going CRAZY cooped up here all by my lonesome!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No way! It’s much too dangerous for an old doll like you!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The chief's not gonna like this. Tch... Ah, what the hell? I can't say no to a face like that. Guess I really am goin' soft."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Nuts to danger! My husband is missing and you boys haven’t done diddly or squat to find him!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "If you won’t do your job, then I will! I used to be a sharpshooter in the army, I’ll have you know!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A/0/c-0/29
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Yes! Ooh, she's so fierce!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A/0/c-0/40
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Bang! Bang! Bang! Bullseye!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A/0/c-0/48
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Heheheh... Yep. I’ve still got it. I’m going after my husband one way or another! Wanna try me, flatfoot?!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A1/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Crazy dame! Fine, get outta here! But I'm warnin' you, you're gonna get yourself killed!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A1/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not if I have anything to say about it! <i>Tackle her to the ground.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A1/0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Um,"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A1/0/2/s/5
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid ". I'm really uncomfortable around guns, actually. Sorry."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A1/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Better to die tryin' than to wait around with flat feet and your thumb stuck where the sun don't shine."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A1/0/c-0/21
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Wait for me, Henry... I'm a comin'."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A1/0/c-0/32
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(What happens next? Find out next week on the next exciting installment of <i>Throw it All Away: The Iron Granny</i>.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A1/0/c-0/40 chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-0/48/c-0/51 chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_4/0/c-0/39 chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/26/g-0/8/g-0/5/c-0/31/c-0/15 chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-0/37 chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-1/7/b/60 chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-1/7/b/44 chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/36/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-0/23 chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_agrressive_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/23 chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/18/c-0/69 chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/55 chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/50/c-0/21/c-0/28/c-0/58/c-0/7 chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-0/39/c-0/21/c-0/39 chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-1/47/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/15 chairemi_chair/thursday_play_spiders/0/c-0/24/c-0/67 chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-1/29/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/26
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Lights down!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A1/0/c-0/74
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "You love to see an old rocking chair sticking it to the man!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A1/0/c-0/82
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Gets me all... riled up! Ho ho!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A1/0/c-0/93
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Yeah, I adore badass grandma characters. Why aren't there more of them?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A1/0/c-0/101
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Like did you guys see <i>Mad Tacks: Fury Rug?</i> There were a ton in that movie and it was awesome!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A1/0/c-1/8/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You dive at Chairemi, fully intent on taking her down, but she just manages to dodge out of the way. You smash into the wall behind her."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A1/0/c-1/8/b/9 chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-0/8/b/9 chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/21/c-1/8/b/9 chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-0/8/b/9
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Whoa!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A1/0/c-1/8/b/20
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oof. You nearly smashed straight into her... Was that part of the show?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A1/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh, no, I'm the one who's sorry! Here."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A1/0/c-2/22
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I'll just... throw this invisible rifle off the stage, like so. Huuup!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A1/0/c-2/30
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Chairemi takes the invisible gun gingerly with two fingers, and then she hurls it away from you into the audience."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A1/0/c-2/41
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Whoa! Careful, dear! That almost invisible hit me!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A1/0/c-2/52
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "And now, I draw... THIS! Shing!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A1/0/c-2/60
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Chairemi draws some invisible weapon from an invisible scabbard at her side."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A1/0/c-2/68
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Stay back! I've got a cursed sword from the 1700s! I won it in a game of poker against some metal chairs back in my bootlegger days! Those guys act tough, but they fold the instant you put the pressure on!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A1/0/c-2/79
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Look out! She's got a sword!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A1/0/c-2/90
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Stand back!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You dive at Chairemi, bringing her crashing down to the floor."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success/0/5
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oof!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success/0/16
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh my goodness gracious!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success/0/27
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "D-Detective, that was very unprofessional. L-let me go!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success/0/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't, Miss. I care about you too much."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Detective! I..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The truth is... your husband ran away. Up and skipped town. We found him awhile ago. I just didn't have the heart to tell you."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/7 chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/c-0/45/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/21
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "What?! No... that... that can't be true!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/15 chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/c-0/45/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/29
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "He..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He's a fool is what he is. Abandoning a good chair like you. If I were your partner, I'd never leave your side."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/7 chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/c-0/45/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "D-Detective...!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/15 chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/c-0/45/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Is that why you've been staying so close to me the whole investigation? The late night talks over tea. Do you... feel something for me?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/23/0/s/0 chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/c-0/45/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/40/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "'Fraid so, doll."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh, Detective... I'm horrible. A part of me was hoping my husband would stay gone, you know? Because then, there was a chance that you and I—"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/23/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Shh, shh, shhh... I'm here now. And I'll stay here until he comes back. And if he never does, well, then... that's just fine by me."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/23/c-0/18/c-0/7 chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/c-0/45/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/40/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Detective..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/23/c-0/18/c-0/15 chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/c-0/45/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/40/c-0/23/c-0/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You kiss Chairemi, doing your best to channel a hardboiled detective kissin' a dame who you knew was trouble."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/23/c-0/18/c-0/34 chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/c-0/45/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/40/c-0/23/c-0/51 chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/c-0/15/b/37 chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/7/b/17 chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-1/7 chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-1/21/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15 chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_3/0/c-0/78/c-0/18 chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_4/0/c-0/69/c-0/18 chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_2/0/c-0/26/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "...lights down."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Thank you, Detective. You're a peach."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Now that we’re on the same team, it's time to look for some clues! Where should we start?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's check out the clue closet."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We should investigate under the covers of the bed together..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Of course! The clue closet! Why didn’t I think of that?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Dear Henry always loved the clue closet. He was always jotting down little notes in there."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Maybe we can figure out where he went based on something he left behind."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Chairemi looks around, tapping at her chin as she thinks."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-0/39
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Let’s see... footprint... painting with eyes that follow you wherever you go... suspiciously stained sheet..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-0/47
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Ah! Here we go! A note! It’s a bit hard to make out. I’ll need my glasses."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-0/55
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She mimes pulling a pair of reading glasses out, unfolding them and putting them on."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-0/63
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "It says... \"Walled in... \""
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-0/71
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Goodness! My husband, Henry David Throw wrote \"Walled in\"! Do you know what that means? He must be trapped in the walls!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-0/93
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "W-We have to get him out of there!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-0/101/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's too late, ma'am. He's been in there for four days. There's no way he could survive that long."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-0/101/c-0/10 chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/c-0/15/b/95 chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/10 chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/c-0/26
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "No!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-0/101/c-0/24
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Y-You're wrong! You HAVE to be!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-0/101/c-0/32
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Henry?! Henry, are you there!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-0/101/c-0/40
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Henry... H-Henry!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-0/101/c-0/48/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry, ma'am. ...he's gone."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-0/101/c-0/48/c-0/13
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "N-No..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-0/101/c-0/48/c-0/21
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The wail of grief Chairemi lets out nearly startles you—it feels so <i>convincing</i>."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-0/101/c-0/48/c-0/29
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "<w>NOOOOOOO-HO-HO-HOOOOOOOOOO!!!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-0/101/c-0/48/c-0/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She slumps to the floor, sobbing on her knees."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-0/101/c-0/48/c-0/59
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh no..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-0/101/c-0/48/c-0/70
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "...and scene!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-0/101/c-0/48/c-0/78 chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/c-1/53 chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-1/86/c-0/37 chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_success/0/c-0/18 chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_4/0/c-0/59 chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/21/c-0/31/c-0/26/c-0/23/c-0/42 chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/c-0/45/c-0/37/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/15 chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Lights down."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-0/101/c-0/48/c-0/95
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "I can't believe it... it's too tragic for words!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-0/101/c-0/48/c-0/103
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Heh. Some people don't like bummer endings, but I do. I like a story that leaves you thinking for awhile after it's done."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_A2/0/c-1/8/b/4
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "M-My gosh..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Come now, detective! What sort of clues could we possibly find there?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We're partners now, ain't we? It would help us get to know each other better."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I... I suppose."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "But what would my husband think?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/c-0/34
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Yes, what about poor Henry?!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/c-0/45/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...damn it all. I can't keep it from you any longer!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/c-0/45/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "What? Keep what from me? What's going on?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/c-0/45/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The truth is... your husband ran away. Up and skipped town."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/c-0/45/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "What?!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/c-0/45/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We found him awhile ago. I didn't have the heart to tell you."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/c-0/45/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/37/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He's a fool is what he is. Abandoning a good woman like you. If I were your partner, I'd never leave your side."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/c-0/45/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/29
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh my goodness!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/c-0/45/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/40/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh, Detective... I'm horrible."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/c-0/45/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/40/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "This whole time, some small part of me was hoping my husband would stay gone, you know? Because then, there was a chance that you and I—"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/c-0/45/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/40/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Shh, shh, shhh... I'm here now. And I'll stay here until he comes back. And if he never does, well, then... that's just fine by me. <i>Kiss her.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/c-0/45/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/40/c-0/23/c-0/29
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Ooh! Ooh! Roof above!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/c-0/45/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/40/c-0/23/c-0/68
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Incredible! What an amazing story!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/c-0/45/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/40/c-0/23/c-0/76
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "There's nothing I adore more than an unlikely romantic twist! Wonderful work, you two! If I had a rose, I'd throw it!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_2/0/c-0/45/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/40/c-0/23/c-0/84
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Haha, thanks Florence."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B/0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "They did?!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B/0/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Well?! What are you waiting for?! What happened?! Is he alright?!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He’s alive! But unfortunately, he’s lost his memory."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’m afraid it’s bad news. ...you may want to sit down for this."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Lost his memory?! Oh, poor Henry!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(Okay, you be Henry now.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/16
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Henry! Oh, my Henry! What’s happened to you?!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "C-Chairemi...? Chairemi, is that you?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Yes! Yes, darling, it’s me!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "<i>Gasp...</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/29
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "It’s incredible. He recognizes me! Henry, dear... what happened to you?! Where have you been?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The only thing I remember... is how much I missed you. <i>Give her a kiss on the cheek</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I was abducted by a secret organization... and they reprogrammed my brain so I’d attack you when you asked me that exact question!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You plant an exaggerated kiss to her cheek—it makes a cartoonishly loud smacking sound."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/c-0/15/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh, Henry..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/c-0/15/b/15 chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-1/8/b/4
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Aww..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/c-0/15/b/26
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "We'll get your memory back... I promise. And until we do, I'll stay right here by your side, my love."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/c-0/15/b/51
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aww. What a bittersweet ending."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/c-0/15/b/68
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "<w>Sniff</w>..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/c-0/15/b/79 chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/c-0/45/c-0/37/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/48
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Now listen here, you two! You can't just hit me with something so... so terribly tragic out of nowhere just like that!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/c-0/15/b/87
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Haha, would you have liked it more if he was dead?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/c-0/15/b/103
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Well... Oh, I don't know!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/c-0/15/b/111
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Excellent work, either way."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/c-0/15/b/119
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Haha. Thanks for coming."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/c-0/16/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh... uh..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/c-1/13
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "What?! Noooooooo!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/c-1/21
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Detective! Detective, help! My husband’s gone crazy!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/c-1/29
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Why aren’t you moving?! No... it can’t be... you’re in on it too?!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/c-1/37
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "<w>Noooooooooooooooooo!!!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/c-1/45
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Dun-dun-dun, lights down!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/c-1/78
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh, um!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/c-1/86
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Woohoo! Great work!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/c-1/94
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "I uh..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/c-1/102
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Well, to be completely honest, you sort of lost me there at the end. But it looked like you two were having fun, at least."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B1/0/c-0/37/c-1/113
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Haha, yeah, we got kind of crazy up there. But to be honest, I’m into it."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I’m a chair, dagnabbit, I’m always sitting down! I can take whatever news you’ve got, just show me!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/11
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "What's the detective showing her? A photograph?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/22
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh... H-Henry!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/30
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "It’s... it’s too horrible for words! He’s been torn limb from limb... by a pet cat!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/41
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Who is responsible for this?! Detective, do you have any leads?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes. In fact... I already worked out who the killer is."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Goodness me! Who was it, Detective? Who killed my poor Henry?!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It was... ME!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It was... YOU!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "<i>Gasp!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-0/18 chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_4/0/3
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "<i>Gasp!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-0/29
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I can’t believe it! The detective was the murderer?! This twist is ABSOLUTELY UNHEARD OF!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-0/37
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "W-What are you going to do with me?!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-0/48/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm afraid I'll have to silence you..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-0/48/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Quit playing around! After all... you're the one who hired me for the job... LOVER!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-0/48/c-0/13
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "No! No..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-0/48/c-0/24
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Noooo!!!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-0/48/c-0/35
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Chairemi looks at you in absolute horror, backing away slowly until..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-0/48/c-0/43
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Bang bang! Ugh... Bleh! I’m... dead!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-0/48/c-0/65
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Ooh, a very grim ending! Just goes to show. You can't trust the cops!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-0/48/c-0/76
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oooh, I can't stand it when the police are in on it! Makes me so gosh darned mad!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-0/48/c-0/87
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "But, if a play makes you feel something, that means it's good!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-0/48/c-0/95
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Great work as always, you two."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-0/48/c-0/103 chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_3/0/c-0/57
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Haha, thanks. And thanks for coming."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-0/48/c-0/111 chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_3/0/c-0/65
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Wouldn't miss it!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-0/48/c-1/8/b/7 chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_3/0/3
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-0/48/c-1/8/b/15 chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_3/0/11
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "What?!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Heh... hehehehe..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-1/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "<w>HAHAHAHAHAHAHA!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-1/34
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "No... No!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-1/45
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "So, you’ve figured me out, have you? Darn. Must’ve spotted the catnip I’ve been growing out back. That was sloppy of me."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-1/53
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "That’s right. I planted catnip on Henry so those feral mountain lions would attack him. And I’d do it again!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-1/61
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "He was cheating on me! With one of those... newfangled \"ergonomic\" chairs! The cad!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-1/75
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "He <i>deserved</i> it!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-1/86/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, it's a good thing you're free. Because you've got a date... with justice."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-1/86/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So what you're saying is, you're single? ...interested in going on a date?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-1/86/c-0/13
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Tch. Guess so."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-1/86/c-0/21
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Looks like this old rocking chair's headed to the Rock..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-1/86/c-0/29
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Farewell... Henry."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-1/86/c-0/54
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Woo! Great job! Wooo!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-1/86/c-0/62
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Did you like that line I threw in at the end there?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-1/86/c-0/70
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Noirs always do that. They have an irredeemable villain say something questionably redeemable to get the audience thinking \"Oh, maybe they weren't so bad after all!\""
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-1/86/c-0/78
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "But they were. They were that bad."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-1/86/c-0/86
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "It's like actually writing something deep and complex, except not! The writer is just cheating!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-1/86/c-0/94
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "I don't know much about writing, but you two are great!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-1/86/c-0/102
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Absolutely loved the twist. Can't wait to catch the next show!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-1/86/c-0/110
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Haha, we'll be here. See you next time, Florence."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/saturday_play_B2/0/c-0/15/c-1/86/c-1/8/b/4
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_3/0/30
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Tch. Now, now. No reason to go and ruin an old woman's fun like that."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_3/0/38
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "You did well, taking out that cheating husband of mine."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_3/0/46
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I like capable humans. And it just so happens that I... recently became single."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_3/0/54
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "What do you say, detective? Partners in crime... <i>and</i> partners in love?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_3/0/62/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ready for my next job... partner."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_3/0/c-0/7 chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/c-0/53/c-0/29
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "...lights down!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_3/0/c-0/24
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh my goodness! I absolutely did NOT see that coming!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_3/0/c-0/35
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "The intrigue... the age gap! It's theatrical dynamite!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_3/0/c-0/49
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Thank you two for an absolutely incredible show."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_4/0/22
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "...are you serious?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_4/0/30
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "You'd really throw away your career as a police officer for a shot with an old antique like me?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_4/0/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sometimes the old things are the best."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_4/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh, you charmer."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_4/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Well... Perhaps it <i>is</i> time I start seeing other people."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_4/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Just make sure you don't go playing around."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_4/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I don't imagine I have to tell you what happens to people who cheat on me..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_4/0/c-0/56
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Goodness..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_4/0/c-0/70
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Haha! What a weird ending! But... I had a lot of fun."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_4/0/c-0/78
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Sorry if that got a little too wild for you, Florence."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_4/0/c-0/86
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "No, no. I like wild!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_4/0/c-0/94
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "(And... I can understand what it's like to want to go after a confident, older woman.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_4/0/c-0/102
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Er! Um!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_4/0/c-0/113
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "S-See you next week!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_4/0/c-0/124
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Bye, Florence."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/mystery_love_success_4/0/c-0/132
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Haha, what was that all about?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/3
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "<i>Mayor Celia's a big fan of classic musicals. Today's play is a little newer, so we might have to work for her approval!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/14
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "I can hear you, you know."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/22
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "I'm willing to branch out... Provided the quality is there."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/33
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Well, you heard her, partner!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/41
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Today's play is about a bunch of mean chairs called the \"Pleathers\"."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/55
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "They act all fancy and uptight, but really? They're super fake."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/63
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Their leader, Scarlett Pleather, bosses everyone around and basically owns the school."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/71
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh my gosh, I just realized!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/79
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Important question: Are you comfortable singing?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/87
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Improvising a play is one thing, but musical improv is pretty tough, especially if you're new. I won't force it if you don't want to."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/95/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can give it a try."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/96/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, I'd rather not sing."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Yeah! I'm sure you'll be great."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Okay, in that case, you can play Scarlett because she gets to sing a lot."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Just be a big jerk and own it and you'll be fine."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/34
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I'll play Skye, the nerdy girl that the Pleathers like to bully all the time."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/42
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I just bumped into you in the cafeteria and things are about to turn ugly."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/50 chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/47 chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/91 chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/36
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Lights up!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/67
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Chairemi acts as though you'd just bumped her, spilling her imaginary books all over the floor."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/75
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Ow!!! My books!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's what you get for trying to <i>read</i>, nerd!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, I'm sorry. Here, let me help you with that."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hmph! You're so mean, Scarlett! Why do you always pick on me?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I have a lot of self-loathing and channeling it into aggression is easier than improving myself as a person! Ha ha!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well it's definitely not because I <i>like</i> you, dork! <i>Sweat obviously</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "W-What?!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/18
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "B-But... I've had a crush on you since we were little kids who used to hang out all the time until you became a bitch!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/26
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "That's our backstory that I'm just this second making up!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/34
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Who could've imagined... that all this time, we were really pining for each other."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/42
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Scarlett. Will you... duet with me?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Duet with her.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Dump pig's blood on her head.</i> \"Prank'd!\""
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ I never thought it'd happen. I mean, me? With the cheer captain? / Seems like something that you'd never dare to dream. ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Release the pig's blood.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "♪ Who'd have even thought I'd text her? This adorable poindexter. / But things, you know, they're never as they seem. ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ Our ruthless high school cliques... Those years of pranks and tricks. ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Hit 'er with the pig's blood.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "♪ But now the two of us are on a team~! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/7 chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ And now~! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Pig's blood.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/1/s/0 chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "♪ Only now~! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ Will we learn to love anew! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Dye this nerd red.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ Can we whisper \"I love you!\" ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ Life's suddenly so different now. Pink clouds around my head! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "♪ And Scarlett's love is raining down. The Skye is turning red. ♪ <i>Pig's blood.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/1/s/0 chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "♪ Only now. ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-0/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ And as it clears... we dry our tears. And liiiiive."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-0/16 chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ Only now. ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(together) ♪ Only now. ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "♪ Only... now. ♪ <i>Kiss her.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "♪ Only... now. ♪ <i>Bow with her.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "♪ Only... now. ♪ <i>Pig's blood.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/7/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You lean in and press your lips to Chairemi's, channeling your best inner mean girl who's just admitted her crush on a nerd."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/7/b/34 chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-1/24
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Well. Bravo, you two."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/7/b/42
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "The lack of any sort of onstage conflict was a strange, if not bold choice..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/7/b/50 chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-1/40
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "But I do respect your ability to come up with a duet on the fly."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/7/b/58
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "And I'd be lying if I said I didn't have a soft spot for an unlikely romantic ending."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/7/b/66 chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-1/56
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "After all, I'm sure you know I'll be right here again tomorrow for Wedding Wednesday."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/7/b/74 chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-1/64
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Haha! Thanks, Celia."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/7/b/82 chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-1/72
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Ta-ta."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/8/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You lean in to kiss Chairemi, but she dodges your lips, a look of disgust on her face."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/8/b/20
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Well. That was rather... Embarrassing."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-1/32
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "The lack of an onstage conflict is a strange, if not bold choice..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-0/15/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-1/23/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-1/48
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "...and I'd be lying if I said I didn't have a soft spot for an unlikely romantic ending."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Imaginary pig's blood rains down on Chairemi, who stands, soaked and devastated."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-1/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Ah! Pig's blood! My sweater vest is ruined! I can't believe it!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-1/26 chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_pigsblood/16
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Like... I <i>literally</i> can't believe it."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-1/37 chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_pigsblood/24
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Seriously, where does a teenage girl get this much pig's blood on short notice? Do your parents own a slaughterhouse or something?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-0/15/c-1/50/c-1/45 chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_pigsblood/32
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/13
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Gee, Scarlett. Thanks. But... I thought you hated schoolwork?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's what everyone thinks. But the truth is... I like books. Sometimes I even... <i>read them</i>."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just kidding! Literacy sucks!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Gasp! But you're a popular girl! And in the zeitgeist of 1980s America, having any kind of academic hobby is somehow worthy of ridicule!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "That makes you... a secret nerd!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "♪ Secret nerd! Secret nerd... / Not a peep! Don't say a word. ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "♪ Secret geek! Secret geek. / They don't know that I'm a freak. ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ I would never! Don't be absurd. / You'll never out a secret nerd. ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/26/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ Who'd suppose when you dress so chic? / I guess that's why you're a secret geek. ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/26/g-0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ It must be nice hanging with girlies. / And not worrying about getting swirlies. ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/26/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "♪ But I still feel like I won the lotto / Each time I read <i>Cask of Amontillado</i>. ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/26/g-0/8/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "♪ I know that I'd be mistaken / Admitting my love for <i>The Road Not Taken</i>. ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/26/g-0/8/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ And If they knew then they would throw to-mah-toes. ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/26/g-0/8/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ Because if they knew, you'd be forsaken. ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/26/g-0/8/g-0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ I guess that's why... ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/26/g-0/8/g-0/5/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "♪ I'm a secret nerd... ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/26/g-0/8/g-0/5/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Golly, Scarlett. That ballad really made me feel for you!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/26/g-0/8/g-0/5/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "If you want, I can show you what it's like to be a nerd."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/26/g-0/8/g-0/5/c-0/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "We can do... a makeover, but in reverse, a make-under. I'll give you glasses, and you can put your hair up in a messy librarian-looking bun."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/26/g-0/8/g-0/5/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow... you'd do that? For me?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/26/g-0/8/g-0/5/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Of course I would... new best friend."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/26/g-0/8/g-0/5/c-0/31/c-0/29
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Well, Miss Mayor? What did you think?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/26/g-0/8/g-0/5/c-0/31/c-0/40
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Hm."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/26/g-0/8/g-0/5/c-0/31/c-0/48
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/26/g-0/8/g-0/5/c-0/31/c-0/56
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Honestly, I thought it was a little silly. It would've been nice to see some actual bullying before the ballad meant to redeem the bully."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/26/g-0/8/g-0/5/c-0/31/c-0/64
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Though, I admit I do have a soft spot for a cold-hearted lady with a passion for literature. And the song was quite nice."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/26/g-0/8/g-0/5/c-0/31/c-0/72
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "All things considered... not my genre, but you two did a great job attempting to convince me that it was. Three and a half stars."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-0/26/g-0/8/g-0/5/c-0/31/c-0/83
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Harsh, but fair! That's the mayor."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-0/83/c-1/21/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "<i>Gasp!</i> No! My expectations! They've been dashed!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "No problem. In that case, I'll play Scarlett because she gets most of the songs."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Not to brag, but I'm quite the songbird! They actually named a game after me. Ever heard of a little thing called \"Musical chairs?\""
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Pfft! I'm joking!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/31
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I'll be Scarlett, and you can play Skye, the down-on-their-luck nerd who the Pleathers always bully."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/39
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "...and you just bumped into them in the cafeteria! Uh oh!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/64
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Tch. Hey! Watch it, geek!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why don't YOU watch it, freak?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Um, I'm sorry, <i>what</i> did you just call me?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ You think you're worth my time, then you're as crazy as a loon. / Standing up to me? Ugh! Gag me with a spoon! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ Or a fork or an eraser... you can even use a knife. / But talk to me that way again? I'm gonna end your life. ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/34
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ You're a decent speller so I know you know your Bees. / But don't you know high school's a hive? And bitch, I am the queen. ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not anymore. This is MY school now!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I know why you bully me like this, Scarlett. It's because you <i>like</i> me."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hey! Get off our table! Aagh, don't step on my lunch! What do you think you're doing, geek?!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "That's it. I'm texting my boyfriend. And when he gets here? You're dead."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/26 chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/39 chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/50/c-0/21/c-0/28/c-0/15 chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/50/c-0/21/c-0/28/c-0/42 chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(Huff, huff, huff...)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/40
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "There she goes, sprinting across the stage."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/51
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Ugh!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/59
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hey baaabe. What's this I hear about your lunch being interrupted by geekfoot?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/67
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "The food here might taste like feet, but it's not supposed to have <i>actual feet in it.</i> Anyone who messes with my girl messes with me!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Beat the tar out of Scarlett's boyfriend.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Engage in a stunning duet/dance battle with Scarlett's boyfriend</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/c-0/8/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You aim a stage punch at Chairemi, but it seems she wasn't expecting this development. She only just manages to dodge, but you still knock her over onto her backside."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/c-0/8/b/23
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Oof. Right onto the floor. That injury doesn't look rehearsed."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/c-1/13
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "(Oh, here comes the awards bait song.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/c-1/18
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ A nerd's a nerd. A jock's a jock. If you don't like it: Tough! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/c-1/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "♪ So many years inside a locker... well tonight, enough's enough! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/c-1/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "♪ You say you're strong. you say you're cool. But I'm calling your bluff! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/c-1/26/g-0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(Whoa! And I thought you said you didn't want to sing!)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/c-1/26/g-0/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(Haha, alright! Let's do this!)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/c-1/26/g-0/16
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ You can walk the walk, but can you talk the talk? The only thing that'chu protect is your pocket! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/c-1/26/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "♪ When I'm done with you you'll need a whole new crew! Put a sock in that mouth and then suck it! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/c-1/26/g-0/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "♪ Whether it's brawn or brain I'm gonna bring the pain! It's not a science but I'm off like a rocket! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/c-1/26/g-0/24/g-0/0 chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/c-1/26/g-0/24/g-0/8/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ Nerds versus jocks! Dadada-dada! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/c-1/26/g-0/24/g-0/8/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "♪ Nerds versus jocks! Dadada-dada! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/c-1/26/g-0/24/g-0/8/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You and Chairemi each hit a series of dance moves more impressive than the last, pushing each other to do more and more. When the time comes for your big crescendo you're nearly out of breath, but you pull through for your last big moment."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/c-1/26/g-0/24/g-0/8/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Hit the high note.</i> ♪ Nerds versus joooooooooooocks!!! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/c-1/26/g-0/24/g-0/8/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Woo! Lights down!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/c-1/26/g-0/24/g-0/8/c-0/23/c-0/27
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Well! Bravo, bravo!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/c-1/26/g-0/24/g-0/8/c-0/23/c-0/38
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Not just one, but two improvised musical numbers. Very impressive."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/c-1/26/g-0/24/g-0/8/c-0/23/c-0/46
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Sigh... I can already tell I'm going to be mumbling \"Nerds Versus Jocks\" under my breath for the next week at work..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/c-1/26/g-0/24/g-0/8/c-0/23/c-0/54
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Great! Then you can come back next Tuesday so we can get a new song stuck in your head."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/c-1/26/g-0/24/g-0/8/c-0/23/c-0/62
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Hah."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/c-1/26/g-0/24/g-0/8/c-0/23/c-0/70
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Excellent work, you two."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-0/75/c-1/26/g-0/24/g-0/8/c-0/23/c-0/87
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Thanks!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Wh..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Of all the stupid... Why would I ever fall for a geeky nobody like you—"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Jeremy Plinkman told me."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "He WHAT?! Ugh, I can't believe he told, I—!!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/26
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "F-Forget it! Whatever!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/34
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Chairemi takes off, running across the stage to get away from you."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/47
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "(Ah. Running downstage. Time for the ballad.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/52
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ It's not fair... that I care... ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/60
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ For a geek that doesn't even comb their hair. ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/68
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ Aceing classes... dorky glasses... ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/76
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ But behind them are the most breathtaking lashes! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/84
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ And those eyes! Oh, those eyes! What I wouldn't give to see them... Staring at me without shaaaame or feeeear! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/92
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ But when I pass them in the halls they only look at floors or walls. Anywhere they can so they won't meet my gaze. ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/100
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ And so I knock books from their hands and all their looks I reprimand and instead of loving them I only haze. ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/108
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ Because when those eyes are passing in the hall... ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/116
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ I'd rather see them angry... than not at all. ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...you could just try asking me out, you know."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whatever lady, here come the punches! <i>Attack.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Skye! U-Um... how much of that did you hear?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Pretty much the whole thing."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All of it. I mean you only walked like four feet away before you started singing."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "O-Oh..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(Hey! It's called a soliloquy! Play along with the space bending!)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Ugh."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/8 chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-1/7/b/20
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Skye..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/16
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "After everything I've done to you... Is there really even any chance that you would say yes?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I would. <i>Hold her hand.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I would. <i>Kiss her.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-0/13
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You take Chairemi's hand in yours, but while she allows you to do it she seems entirely creeped out."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-0/21
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "O-Oh... Skye... you're so sweet."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-0/29
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Would you... like to sit with me at lunch next time?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-0/51
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aww. What a sweet story."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-0/59
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "It just goes to show you: Whenever people are mean to you, it's probably because they secretly think you're really hot."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-0/67
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Hah. Is that the lesson of the day?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-0/75
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-0/83
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "So next time someone complains about their zoning order... Know that it's because they think you're a fox!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-0/91
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Chairemi. Honey."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-0/99
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "I <i>am</i> a fox."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-0/107
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Haha! You know it!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-0/115
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Thanks for coming, Miss Mayor. I'll see you again soon!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-1/7/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You kiss Chairemi the way you think a nerd might kiss a cheerleader."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-1/7/b/9
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Ah..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-1/7/b/28
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "T-That was my first kiss..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-1/7/b/36
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I mean, besides the quarterback. And the cheer captain. And that guy from space camp."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-1/7/b/44
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "But like, this is the first one that meant something."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-1/7/b/52
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I promise not to bully you anymore. ...unless you want me to."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-1/7/b/77
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Bravo."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-1/7/b/85
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "You liked it?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-1/7/b/93 chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-1/7/b/93
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-1/7/b/101
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "I might be partially made of stone, but even my heart warms to see a catty shrew find love."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-1/7/b/109
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Gives me hope for myself."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-1/7/b/117
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aww, mayor."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-1/7/b/125
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Well, I'll be sure to remember that during tomorrow's Wedding Wednesday play."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-1/7/b/133
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Wouldn't miss it for the world."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-1/8/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You do your best to kiss Chairemi, but she places a hand to your lips, pushing you away with barely concealed disgust. She does her best to stay in character, but you can tell this was unwelcome."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-0/15/g-0/24/c-1/8/b/9
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-1/7/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You throw a stage punch at Chairemi, who rolls with it so smoothly you'd think this was choreographed. She dives back against the wall."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-1/7/b/9
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "No! After years of bullying everyone I meet, I am met with any level of consequences!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-1/7/b/17
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I completely deserve this!!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-1/7/b/25
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Bleh... I am... knocked out~!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-1/7/b/33
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "... And so, Scarlett's reign of terror over the school ended. Not thanks to the power of love or forgiveness... but because of gratuitous violence."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-1/7/b/58
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "...well? What did you think?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-1/7/b/66
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Honestly?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-1/7/b/74
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "I loved it."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-1/7/b/85
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-1/7/b/101
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Too many stories end with a hackneyed lesson about forgiveness."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-1/7/b/109
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "I'm a public servant. You'll forgive me if I enjoy seeing a story about obnoxious people getting their comeuppance."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-1/7/b/117
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Haha, careful mayor! You wouldn't want that getting around during election season."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-1/7/b/125
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Oh, please. Like anyone ever runs against me."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-1/7/b/133
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Anyways, wonderful work you two. I thoroughly enjoyed it."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-1/7/b/141
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "I'll be coming by again tomorrow, Chairemi."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-1/7/b/149
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "See you then, Miss Mayor!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-1/8/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You throw a clumsy stage punch at Chairemi, and while she manages to move out of the way of your fist, she still falls backwards onto her posterior. It looks a bit painful."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play/0/c-1/72/c-0/42/c-1/23/c-0/124/c-1/8/b/20
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "(Oof. That stage dive didn't look rehearsed.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_success/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You aim a harmless stage punch at Chairemi and she goes for it, flying backwards against the wall and crying out in mock-pain."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_success/0/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Ow! Oof!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_success/0/16
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "This nerd's attacks... they're so strong!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_success/0/24
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "All that time punching numbers into a calculator has toned their ACTUAL punches to a lethal degree!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_success/0/32
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oof!!! ...bleugh. I'm, like... wasted, bro!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_success/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nerds of Whatever-This-School-is-Called High... you are free!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_success/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "The cafeteria explodes into cheers! The reign of the Pleathers is over! Massive applause! Yaaay! Yaaay!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_success/0/c-0/35
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Hmm. Bravo, you two."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_success/0/c-0/43
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "A solid song and plot structure. Not bad, not bad at all."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_success/0/c-0/51
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Though I must say, I don't care much for the high school setting."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_success/0/c-0/59
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Why are films and stageplays so fixated on high school? Even a college campus would make for a much richer setting..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_success/0/c-0/67
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "But, I digress."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_success/0/c-0/75
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "I'll be back tomorrow for the Wednesday play, darling."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_success/0/c-0/83
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "See you then, Celia!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_pigsblood/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Ah! Pig's blood! And right in the middle of my ballad! My most vulnerable moment!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_pigsblood/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "My fragile sense of trust and my sweater vest are both ruined! I can't believe it!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_pigsblood/37
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Anyways..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Ooh, I knew it! You really are just a no-good bully!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I know what I have to do now! I'll prank you! I'll prank you in a way that goes wrong and somehow results in your death!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/16
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "...which is a weirdly common occurrence in horror-comedy musicals!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/24
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "<i>Ahem!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/32
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Here, Scarlett. I bought you a drink from the vending machine as a peace offering. It certainly isn't spiked with anything."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wow! Unsuspicious is my favorite flavor! <i>Drink poison.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You tip your head back, draining the imaginary bottle Chairemi offers you."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "(Oh, come on now, Scarlett.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/20
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Wait a minute... I mixed up the laxatives with rat poison! I knew we shouldn't have kept those bottles next to each other!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/28
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh no... it's too late! She's DEAD!!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/36/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "♪ Ghost! I'm a ghost now! In case it's not apparent even though I turned transparent I'm a ghost! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/36/c-0/7 chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/36/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "♪ She's a ghost! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/36/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "♪ I'm a ghost! ♪"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/36/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "♪ I'm a ghost now! I know it's hard to tell, they didn't costume me that well but I'm a ghost! I'm a ghost! ♪ BOO!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/36/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aagh!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/36/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Scarlett... please! I'm so sorry! I didn't mean for this to happen!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/36/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/26
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I mean, I'll be honest, I wouldn't be too torn up about it if you weren't haunting me right now, but since there are consequences I'M SO SORRY."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/36/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually being a ghost is awesome. Do you want to, like, go solve mysteries together?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/36/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, don't worry. I won't do anything... you'll do it yourself! <i>Grab Chairemi and possess her.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/36/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aw, really? That sounds so fun! Sorry I murdered you and stuff."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/36/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's cool. High school is usually the peak for mean girls, anyways. Most of us just, like, become nurses or something"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/36/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-0/13
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Hah!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/36/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-0/18
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "True."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/36/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-0/37
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "... Well? What did you think?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/36/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-0/48
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Hm. Well, to be honest, the ending was a tad silly for my tastes..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/36/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-0/56
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "But, I did like the ghost song. And the dig at nurses."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/36/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-0/64
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Ugh. This one ceiling I used to know. Thought she was all that and a bag of wood chips just because she was installed in a hospital."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/36/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-0/72
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Anyways, thank you as always for the lovely performance, Chairemi. I'll be looking forward to the next one."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/36/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-0/80 chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_agrressive_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/80
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aww, thanks Miss Mayor! You're always welcome!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/36/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/8/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You grab Chairemi, intent on forcing her to pretend to punch herself, but she writhes in your grasp, her face the very picture of disgust."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/36/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/8/b/12
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Shingles above, what is going on?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/tuesday_play_poison/0/c-0/36/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/34/c-1/8/b/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Agh... hey! L-Let go!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_agrressive_2/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You grab Chairemi's fists, forcing her to pretend to punch herself. She plays along expertly."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_agrressive_2/0/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "No! I can't control my body!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_agrressive_2/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Stop hitting yourself, stop hitting yourself!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_agrressive_2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Ow! My fragile nerd skin!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_agrressive_2/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Quit being such a wallflower, Skye! Why don't you get out there and dance?!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_agrressive_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh no! I can't cut a rug! That's school property! Who's going to write me college recommendations now?!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_agrressive_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "<w>Nooooooooooooo!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_agrressive_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/37
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hahh... hahh..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_agrressive_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/45
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Well? What did you think?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_agrressive_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/56
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Hm. Well, to be honest, the ending was a tad juvenile for my tastes..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_agrressive_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/64
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "But, I did like the ghost song."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/schoolhouse_love_agrressive_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/72
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Thank you as always for the lovely performance, Chairemi. I'll be looking forward to the next one."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/6
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(No pressure, but Celia and Florence look forward to this one every week. Let's do our best!)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/17 chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/21 chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/21/c-0/31/c-0/26/c-0/23/c-0/59 chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success/0/c-0/32
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Woo!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/36
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Today’s play is about a poor duchess. A bride-to-be, left at the altar—played by myself."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/50
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "What will happen to her? Will her true love show up to whisk her away? Or will she have to marry the nefarious Count Lionel instead?!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/58
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Boo! Boo, Count Lionel, boooo!!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/69
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Dear, hush."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/83
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "You can play whoever you want in this one. What happens is up to you!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/108
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Sigh..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/116
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh, Marquis DeMarquisio... Why have you abandoned me? This was supposed to be the happiest day of our lives!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/124
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(Suddenly, there’s a knock at the church door! Bang! Someone enters!)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/132
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(...that’s you!)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/140/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Worry not, fair Chairabelle! Tis I, Marquis DeMarquisio!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/141/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bah hah hah! It is I, the mustachioed Count Lionel! (Thunder! Lightning! Pshoo, pa-choom!)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "DeMarquisio! Oh, thank heavens!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Darling, where have you been?! We were supposed to be married hours ago!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I feared you’d left me at the altar!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I’m sorry, my dear. I was waylaid by highwaymen! The Count’s men accosted me at every turn, but in the end, love has triumphed, and I am here!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Chairabelle... my dear, Esther Chairabelle. The truth is, I’ve fallen in love... with someone else!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh, I'm so happy! Come, DeMarquisio! Let's get married right away!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "\"DeMarquisio?\" Tonight it’s... \"More-kiss-io\". <i>Dip Chairemi and lay one on her.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Alack, I cannot! For you see, the count has afflicted me... with a terrible curse!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-0/8/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You dip Chairemi, but she twists away from your kiss, her face radiating disgust."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-0/8/b/23
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Huh? Why did she dodge the kiss?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-0/8/b/34
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Dear. Quiet."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-1/13
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "No! What is it?!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-1/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You see... every time the sun sets... I turn into... A FROG!!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-1/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "NO!!! I hate frogs!!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-1/21/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I KNOW!!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-1/21/c-0/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Whatever will we do?!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-1/21/c-0/18/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe we could— Ah! No! It is too late! I can already feel the curse taking hold of me!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-1/21/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Chairabelle... I... l-love...!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-1/21/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "You l-love??"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-1/21/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "RIBBIT."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-1/21/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "DeMarquisio! <w>NOOOOOOOOO!!!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-1/21/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/51
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Haha, what a silly ending!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-1/21/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/59 chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-0/39/c-0/21/c-0/94
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Indeed."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-1/21/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/67
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "(Sorry, did I miss something? Did they set up the frog thing earlier?)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-1/21/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/75
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "(No, dearest. The improv wasn't the best, this time around.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-1/21/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/83
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "(Ohhhh.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-1/21/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/91
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Well. Nevertheless, thank you as always for an... interesting evening."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-1/21/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/99
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Come, Florence."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-1/21/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/107 chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/18/c-0/98/b/79 chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/110
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Bye!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-1/21/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/121
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Haha!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-1/21/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/129
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "They hated it."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-0/15/c-1/21/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/137
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aw well, don't mind them. I had a great time!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "GASP!!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/18
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "No! DeMarquisio! How could you?!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/26
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "We went on a romantic boat ride together! I... simply can’t believe it!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/34
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Who is it? What scoundrel has stolen my beloved's heart?!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I fear it is a scoundrel that you know all too well. For I have fallen in love... WITH COUNT LIONEL!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, there’s this foxy actress I’m into... Green? Four legs? Maybe you know her?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/21
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Count Lionel?! But he is my family’s archnemesis! He’s attempted to foil our relationship at every turn!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes. Out of jealousy. Because this whole time... he was in love with me!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Goodness!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "He promises that if I marry him he will leave your family alone for the rest of your days. This way, we can all be happy..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I’m happy that you’re happy, my dear... but... I cannot lie. My heart aches at the thought of being without you."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well, what if I married... both of you?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Gasp! A three-way wedding! That’s... three times as beautiful as a normal wedding!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/18/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh, my love! I accept! The three of us will be so happy together!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/18/c-0/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Thank you, my love! Thank you..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/18/c-0/31
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Esther Chairabelle marrying two people at once... People might start calling me \"Poly Esther!\" Which is also the material I'm made of!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/18/c-0/39
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Ba-dum-tish!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/18/c-0/50
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Haha!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/18/c-0/61
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Boo."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/18/c-0/89
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Wow, a poly ending. You never see those! Shocking AND good representation? Nice!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/18/c-0/97/b/4
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Yes. Though I can't help but wonder if our dearest was perhaps pandering to us a bit?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/18/c-0/97/b/15
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh, I don't mind! It makes me feel all warm and fuzzy, like a shag carpet!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/18/c-0/97/b/23
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Lovely work, you two. See you next week!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/18/c-0/97/b/31
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Bye!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/18/c-0/98/b/4
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Yes. Very interesting indeed."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/18/c-0/98/b/15
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Really, Miss Mayor? I thought you'd be opposed to it!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/18/c-0/98/b/23
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Not at all."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/18/c-0/98/b/31
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "In fact, I don't think I'd mind being in a relationship like that myself, should I be so lucky."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/18/c-0/98/b/39
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "R-Really? Wow... Um..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/18/c-0/98/b/47
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "I'll keep that in mind!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/18/c-0/98/b/55
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/18/c-0/98/b/63
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Thank you both so much for coming out! See you next week?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/18/c-0/98/b/71
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Of course, dear. See you then."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-1/8/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Chairemi, Celia, and Florence all seem to share the same confusion and disgust at your confession."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-0/34/c-1/45/c-1/8/b/32
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "No! Not Count Lionel and his unholy ability to command lightning!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Now that DeMarquisio has abandoned me, I’ll have to marry HIM if I want any hope at saving our family farm!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That’s right, Chairabelle! And if you don’t agree to marry me, then I’ll turn your family’s beloved puppy farm into a SNAKE MINE!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, I've decided to turn over a new leaf. I'll let you keep your farm... on ONE condition!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "GASP! You FIEND! You know that I'm terrified of snakes! And I'm especially terrified at the prospect of mining them!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/18
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "You can't! You simply can't! I won't let you!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Very well, my pretty! If I can't have you as my bride... then no one will! En garde! <i>Make eye contact and pull out a sword.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You don't have a choice! Come here! <i>Grab her.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You stab Chairemi with your invisible sword, and she staggers back, one hand on her chest."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/c-0/18
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Goodness!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/c-0/29
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Fight back, Chairabelle, fight back!!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/c-0/37
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hahh... hahh... Not today, Count!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/c-0/45
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Chairemi pulls an invisible sword of her own, skewering you with it."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/c-0/53/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ah! Alas! I am stabbed... I... die! Bleh!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/c-0/53/c-0/7
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Yes! YES!!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/c-0/53/c-0/21
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Your swordsmanship is no match for the power of love. I will find DeMarquisio. And nothing in this world can stop me. Not you. Not anything!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/c-0/53/c-0/46
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Woo! Amazing!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/c-0/53/c-0/57
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Well. I'm impressed. That was quite the sword fight."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/c-0/53/c-0/65
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Especially considering it was all improvised."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/c-0/53/c-0/73
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Haha, yeah. I'm sweating a bit!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/c-0/53/c-0/81
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Me too..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/c-0/53/c-0/89
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Florence, please, control yourself."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/c-0/53/c-0/100
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh. S-Sorry..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/c-0/53/c-0/111
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Excellent work as always, Chairemi. We'll be sure to be back next week."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/c-0/53/c-0/119
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Wonderful! See you then!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/c-0/53/c-0/133
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Ooh, what an intense finale! You love to see a girl winning."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/c-1/8/b/1 chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/8/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "<w>!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/c-1/8/b/12 chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/8/b/9
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You try to grab for Chairemi, but she twists out of reach before you can touch her, sending you hurtling to the ground. It's hard to breathe for a few moments."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/c-1/8/b/23 chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/8/b/20
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Aaaand, the human slammed right into the floor."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/c-1/8/b/34 chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/8/b/31
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oof. That definitely hurt them more than it hurt me."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Really? What is it?! I'll do anything!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Isn't it obvious? I'll let you keep your farm... If you MARRY ME! <i>Grab her.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sniff... Teach me how to read!!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "You... don't know how to read?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "My secret shame!!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "That explains so much... Like why you'd never return our letters pleading with you to leave our farm alone."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "And why it was so easy to fool you during chase sequences by turning signs 180 degrees so they'd point the wrong way."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Very well, Count. If you promise to leave me be... I shall teach you to read."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/31
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(And so, the young woman taught the despicable old man. Every day in the little schoolhouse on her farm, they would go letter by letter.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/39
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(Eventually he learned to read sentences, then entire passages by himself. And as he opened his mind... so too did he open his heart.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/47
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(The end.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/75
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Aww."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/83
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "A bit strange that we never learned what happened to the Marquis, though!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/91
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Ah, that's the sequel hook! To find out, you'll have to come back... next week!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/wednesday_play/0/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-1/15/c-0/99
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "We most certainly will. See you then, Chairemi."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You sweep Chairemi off her feet and kiss her as the lights go down."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success/0/16
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "...wow. Wasn't expecting the dip."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success/0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Did I do something wrong?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "No, no! It was hot."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I-I MEAN. It was a really interesting ending to the play!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(Aaaaaah, stop talking, Chairemi... )"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success/0/c-0/40
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "S-So, um..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success/0/c-0/54
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Woo! Get it, girl!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success/0/c-0/65
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Florence."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success/0/c-0/73
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "S-Sorry, Miss Mayor. I get excited."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success/0/c-0/89
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Yes though, do \"Get it\", Chairemi."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success/0/c-0/97
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Y-You guys!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success/0/c-0/105
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "That play was unusually short. But I can see the two of you have other things on your mind."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success/0/c-0/113
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Come, Florence. Let's get out of their way."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success/0/c-0/121
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Huh? O-Oh! R-Right, of course!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success/0/c-0/129
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "You guys... aaah, you're making me so embarrassed!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_2/0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Pfft, haha! Hey! You can't just break character like that!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_2/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But it's true! I've fallen for her, Esther! I just want to grab her and chair dance with her!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Whoa! Hahaha! Jeez! Alright, alright!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_2/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "...showing up the bride at her wedding is pretty rude, you know."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_2/0/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I have no regrets!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_2/0/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "DeMarquisio, you're incorrigible!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_2/0/c-0/23/c-0/18
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Goodness. Perhaps we should leave these two to their own devices."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_2/0/c-0/23/c-0/29
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh! Oh, yes!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_2/0/c-0/23/c-0/37
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Wouldn't want to... get in the way. Ho ho!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_2/0/c-0/23/c-0/45
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "H-Hey! You guys, wait! Did you like the play?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_2/0/c-0/23/c-0/59
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "...ah, they're gone."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_2/0/c-0/23/c-0/67
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "You dork! You scared them off!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_3/0/0 chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_4/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You grab Chairemi from behind, pulling her close to your chest. She puts up a good show of struggling."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_3/0/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Agh! Let me go! (Let me go!)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_3/0/19
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Chairabelle, look out!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_3/0/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Just then, Chairemi reverses your hold, slamming you against the wall—all safely, of course. She is a pro, after all."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_3/0/38
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh! Oh my goodness!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_3/0/49
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "That's quite a grapple."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_3/0/63/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hahh... hahh... Look at that, Chairabelle. We can't keep our hands off each other... Meanwhile that so-called \"fiancé\" of yours is nowhere to be seen."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_3/0/c-0/7 chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_4/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Horrible! You're horrible!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_3/0/c-0/15 chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_4/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "You'll never understand what we feel for one another! Our hearts are filled with love... but you, I'm not even sure that you HAVE a heart!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_3/0/c-0/26 chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_4/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Let's find out!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_3/0/c-0/34 chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_4/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She pulls an imaginary knife from somewhere, raising it high in the air."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_3/0/c-0/45 chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_4/0/c-0/39
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Ooh, she's got a knife."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_3/0/c-0/56 chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_4/0/c-0/50
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Get him, Chairabelle! Get him!!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_3/0/c-0/64 chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_4/0/c-0/61
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Stab!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_3/0/c-0/78/0/s/0 chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_4/0/c-0/69/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aaaaaagh! No! Alas... I... d..i... e... Bleh!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_3/0/c-0/78/c-0/7 chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_4/0/c-0/69/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hahh... hahh... Now. To find the man who's going to be my husband."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_3/0/c-0/78/c-0/38 chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_4/0/c-0/69/c-0/35
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Bravo! Bravo!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_3/0/c-0/78/c-0/46 chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_4/0/c-0/69/c-0/46
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Haha. You're so easy to please whenever there's a fight that leaves people rolling on the floor."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_3/0/c-0/78/c-0/54 chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_4/0/c-0/69/c-0/54
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "What can I say? I like being involved!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_3/0/c-0/78/c-0/62 chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_4/0/c-0/69/c-0/62
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Good work, you too. A very compelling show. Can't wait to see next week's performance."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_3/0/c-0/78/c-0/76 chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_4/0/c-0/69/c-0/76
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "And I can't wait to perform it! Bye!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_4/0/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "GASP! You reprobate! You haven't changed a bit!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_4/0/16
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Agh! Let me go!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_4/0/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The two of you struggle, grappling back and forth across the church floor. You let Chairemi direct the action. It looks pretty intense, but like any good stage combat, the \"victim\" is in control of the action."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/marquis_love_success_4/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hahh... Look at that, Chairabelle. We can't keep our hands off each other... Meanwhile that so-called \"fiancé\" of yours is nowhere to be seen."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/3
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(Did you know that Celia is here every week? Turns out she loves sci-fi stuff! Who knew!)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/14
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "I <i>can</i> hear you, you know."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/22
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "And what's so wrong with that? Can't an old girl like me have a hobby?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/30
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "I was around back when Stair Trek was first released, you know. I've been a fan since day one."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/38
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Go on."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/46
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aye aye, space commander."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/57
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Today’s play is about a group of space explorers. You're the captain of our starship, and I'm your robot assistant and navigator."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/88
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "BEEP BOOP. ALL SYSTEMS ARE GREEN CAPTAIN. WE ARE SURROUNDED BY BOTH THE VASTNESS OF SPACE AND THE ENDLESS PROSPECT OF ADVENTURE."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/96
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "QUERY: WHERE SHALL WE GO?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/104/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's explore an alien world!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/105/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's explore the ship."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "UNDERSTOOD. PLOTTING A COURSE FOR THE NEARBY PLANET \"CLOSETRON 5\"."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "VrrrrRRRRRRR!!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "(Bouncing up and down to imitate a spaceship entering warp speed. Classic.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "WE HAVE ARRIVED, CAPTAIN. SCANNERS DETECT A GATHERING OF ALIENS OUTSIDE. THEY ARE ARMED."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/39
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "WHAT WOULD YOU LIKE TO DO?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's befriend the aliens. Tell them we come in the name of peace and love."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's attack the aliens."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(You and Chairbot disembark, speaking to the aliens.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-0/18
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(Unfortunately, they misinterpret your signs of peace and take you captive! Their leader speaks to you!)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-0/26
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Human invader! We are a stable race of four-legged creatures! But your robot companion...it is a SWIVEL chair! This brings chaos! Instability!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-0/37
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "You claim to be here in the name of \"peace\" and \"love\", but surely you plan to destroy us!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-0/45
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(...just then, an explosion! Giant spider-like creatures begin invading the alien camp!)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-0/56
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Agh! It's the Ottoman Empire! We will be overrun! What can we do?!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "UNDERSTOOD. FIRING FORWARD LASERS. PEW PEW PEW!!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/18
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Human scum! No one attacks us Fourlegs! We will assemble our greatest forces and destroy every human in the galaxy!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/26
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "CAPTAIN. I HAVE ASSESSED THE THREAT LEVEL."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/34
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "THESE CREATURES POSE A THREAT TO THE ENTIRE UNIVERSE. WE MUST DEFEAT THEM HERE AND NOW IF WE ARE TO HAVE ANY HOPE OF SURVIVAL."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/42
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I HAVE FORMULATED TWO PLANS TO CREATE A SUPERWEAPON CAPABLE OF DEFEATING THEM. PLEASE SELECT ONE."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/50/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's convert the ship into a superweapon. <i>Sacrifice your ship.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/50/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Let's convert you into a superweapon. <i>Reach over and reconstruct Chairbot.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/50/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "CAPTAIN. I MUST WARN YOU THAT IF WE CONVERT THE SHIP INTO A WEAPON, WE WILL HAVE NO HOPE OF GETTING OFF-PLANET."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/50/c-0/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "There's no time! Just do it!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/50/c-0/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "UNDERSTOOD."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/50/c-0/21/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Chairbot mimes moving some parts around."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/50/c-0/21/c-0/20
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "WEAPON COMPLETED. FIRE WHEN READY, CAPTAIN."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/50/c-0/21/c-0/28/0/s/0 chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fire!!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/50/c-0/21/c-0/28/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "FIRING."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/50/c-0/21/c-0/28/c-0/29
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "(I do enjoy watching Chairemi run back and forth across the stage to change characters. It never loses its charm.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/50/c-0/21/c-0/28/c-0/34
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aaaaaagh! The human weapon is destroying us! <w>NoooooOOOOOOO!!!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/50/c-0/21/c-0/28/c-0/50
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "THE ALIENS HAVE BEEN DEFEATED, CAPTAIN. BUT WE WILL HAVE TO LIVE OUT THE REST OF OUR DAYS HERE."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/50/c-0/21/c-0/28/c-0/58/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A small price... to protect the Earth."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/50/c-0/21/c-0/28/c-0/58/c-0/24
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Bravo, captain."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/50/c-0/21/c-0/28/c-0/58/c-0/32
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "A brave choice. Giving up one's individual happiness to protect the greater good. I think I feel a bit of kinship with this character."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/50/c-0/21/c-0/28/c-0/58/c-0/40
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aw, mayor. I hope you didn't think of your job as giving up your own happiness! Haha."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/50/c-0/21/c-0/28/c-0/58/c-0/56
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "M-Mayor?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/50/c-0/21/c-0/28/c-0/58/c-0/64
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Anyways, great work you two! See you next week."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/50/c-0/21/c-0/28/c-0/58/c-0/81
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Huh. Wonder what that was all about."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/50/c-0/21/c-0/28/c-0/58/c-0/89
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aw well."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/50/c-1/8/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Chairemi gives you an icy stare."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-0/47/c-1/50/c-1/8/b/12
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Well. That's. <i>Handsier</i> than I expected things to get."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "EXCELLENT IDEA, CAPTAIN. IT IS IMPORTANT TO MAKE SURE THE SHIP IS IN, QUOTE, \"SHIP SHAPE\" BEFORE WE ATTEMPT ANY INTERSTELLAR TRAVEL."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "BEEP! WAIT A MOMENT! CAPTAIN! I SENSE SOMETHING! THERE IS A PROBLEM SOMEWHERE ON BOARD."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I AM SENDING THE DATA TO YOUR MONITOR NOW. WHAT DO YOU MAKE OF IT, CAPTAIN?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh no! A critical part of the reactor core is malfunctioning!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh no! Scanners indicate that there’s an evil shapeshifter on board!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I WILL ASSESS THE DAMAGE."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-0/15 chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "SCANNING... SCANNING... SCANNING..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-0/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "THERE IS GOOD NEWS, CAPTAIN. THE PART IN QUESTION IS A Q5000 SPINDLE CORE. THIS IS THE SAME COMPONENT THAT ALLOWS ME TO FUNCTION."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-0/31
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "IF YOU DISASSEMBLE ME, WE CAN SAVE THE SHIP."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I refuse! You’re a member of this crew just like everyone else. Let’s abandon ship!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-0/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I can't disassemble you, Chairbot... Because I love you. <i>Hug Chairemi</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-0/39/c-0/13
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "THIS COURSE OF ACTION IS HIGHLY ILLOGICAL. SURELY I AM NOT AS VALUABLE AS THE REST OF THE CREW."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-0/39/c-0/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I won't leave a single member of my crew behind, Chairbot. That includes you."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-0/39/c-0/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "CAPTAIN..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-0/39/c-0/21/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "MY SENSORS INDICATE THAT I AM TOUCHED BY THIS ACTION."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-0/39/c-0/21/c-0/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "UNDERSTOOD. WE WILL EVACUATE THE SHIP IMMEDIATELY."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-0/39/c-0/21/c-0/31
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "WE WILL GO... TOGETHER."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-0/39/c-0/21/c-0/56
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Aw. Well, I do enjoy a story about a loyal employer sacrificing for their underling."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-0/39/c-0/21/c-0/70
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Well done, you two."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-0/39/c-0/21/c-0/78
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Yeah, I've never understood movies where robots are treated like second class citizens."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-0/39/c-0/21/c-0/86
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "They're just little guys! Be nice to them!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-0/39/c-0/21/c-0/102
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Well, this was a lovely little diversion, but I have to get back to my desk."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-0/39/c-0/21/c-0/110
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Thank you two for a wonderful time."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-0/39/c-0/21/c-0/124
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Bye, mayor! See you next Tuesday!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-0/39/c-1/8/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You try to pull Chairemi into a hug, but she dodges away from you, hands out in front of her to keep you at a distance."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-0/39/c-1/8/b/9
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "W-Whoa, uh... no thank you!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "UNDERSTOOD. I WILL CONNECT TO THE MAINFRAME AND BEGIN A SHIP-WIDE SCAN OF THE CREW."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-1/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "SCAN COMPLETE. PROCESSING. BEEP BOOP."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-1/31
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "...CAPTAIN. THESE RESULTS ARE... CONCERNING."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-1/39
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "THE REST OF THE CREW APPEARS TO HAVE HUMAN DNA. THE ONLY ONE THE SCAN COULD NOT CONFIRM WAS..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-1/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's right. Me. I'm sorry, Chairbot. I'm afraid I can't let you leave this room assembled. <i>Scream like an alien and attack Chairbot.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-1/47/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's right, Chairbot. I'm an alien. My job was to infiltrate this ship, take it over... and then take over Earth. Join me."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-1/47/c-1/13
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "BEEP! THIS DOES NOT COMPUTE! QUERY: WHY WOULD I JOIN YOU TO DESTROY THE OTHERS?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-1/47/c-1/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Come now, you and I both know these humans don't respect you. They see you as lesser. But I've always been a friend to you... haven't I, Chairbot?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-1/47/c-1/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "NO! THEY. THE OTHERS RESPECT ME."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-1/47/c-1/21/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do they? The other day I saw the gunner use you as a coaster. Join me, we can make a world where all creatures are created equal... mechanical and be-fleshed alike!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-1/47/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "CALCULATING OFFER..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-1/47/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "BEEP. VERY WELL. INSTALLING BETRAYAL DRIVERS."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-1/47/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "CR-CHUNK! EVIL BEEP. INSTALLATION COMPLETE."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-1/47/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thank you, my friend. Now... let's get this ship back to earth. Hahahaha... HAHAHAHAHA!!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-1/47/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "HA. HA. HA. HA. HA."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-1/47/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/29
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Ooh, a spooky ending! Ominous. I'm about it, I'm about it."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-1/47/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/40 chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_3/0/c-0/50
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Yes. Sometimes it's nice to change things up with a more dystopian feel."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-1/47/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/48 chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_3/0/c-0/58
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "I've always had an affinity for robot characters anyways, so I often find myself rooting for them."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-1/47/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/56 chairemi_chair/thursday_play_spiders/0/c-0/24/c-0/121 chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_3/0/c-0/66
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Good work, you two. I'll be sure to catch the follow-up next week."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play/0/c-1/31/c-1/47/c-1/21/c-0/15/c-0/31/c-0/67 chairemi_chair/thursday_play_spiders/0/c-0/24/c-0/132 chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_3/0/c-0/77
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Thanks, mayor! See you later!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play_spiders/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Insist on making peace with the aliens.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play_spiders/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Insist on making love with the aliens.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play_spiders/0/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Um..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play_spiders/0/2/s/5
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "! Can they not be spider-like? Spiders freak me out."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play_spiders/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(Hi-yah! We break through our bonds!)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play_spiders/0/c-0/24/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Give a speech to the monsters using Chairbot as a translation device.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play_spiders/0/c-0/24/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Wow! What an incredible speech!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play_spiders/0/c-0/24/c-0/18
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "They're retreating... I never thought it was possible to broker a peace with those monsters!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play_spiders/0/c-0/24/c-0/26
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Perhaps I was too hasty with them."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play_spiders/0/c-0/24/c-0/34
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "...perhaps I have been too hasty with you as well, human."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play_spiders/0/c-0/24/c-0/42
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "From this day forwards, our species shall be allies!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play_spiders/0/c-0/24/c-0/50
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hip hip... <w>(SCREECHING ALIEN NOISE)</w>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play_spiders/0/c-0/24/c-0/78
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Great work, Captain. That was a classic, pulpy space adventure."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play_spiders/0/c-0/24/c-0/89
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Indeed. ...though, I could do without the screech at the end, thank you."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play_spiders/0/c-0/24/c-0/97
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Uh, that's called <i>getting into character</i>."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play_spiders/0/c-0/24/c-0/105
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "It's called \"threatening to shatter my chandel-earrings\"."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play_spiders/0/c-0/24/c-0/113
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "The rest of the play, however, was quite enjoyable."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play_spiders/0/c-1/8/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You try to kiss Chairemi's cheek, but she dodges away from you, utterly disgusted. You can feel the disdain radiating from Celia in the audience. It seems this was not the best idea."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play_spiders/0/c-1/8/b/12
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Um!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play_spiders/0/c-2/11
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh, sure, no problem. Let's make them floating UFO-shaped stool monsters instead."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/thursday_play_spiders/0/c-2/22
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "The floating stool monsters approach! What will you do?!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success/0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "UNDERSTOOD, CAPTAIN. RECONSTRUCTING MYSELF."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success/0/11
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "BEEP! BOOP! VRRRRRRT!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success/0/19
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "KER-CHUNK. TRANSFORMATION COMPLETE. PILOT REQUIRED TO START."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...so, should I get in the cockpit?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "AFFIRMATIVE."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're okay with me slotting myself here and sitting in your lap?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "A-AFFIRMATIVE:"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Okay! Let's go, Chairbot!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You take a careful seat on Chairemi's lap. She seems a bit flustered, but she rallies well."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Ah... Er, UNDERSTOOD CAPTAIN. FIRE WHEN READY!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Pew! Pew, pew, pew!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Pew!!! Pew, pew!!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/18/c-0/10
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Here, I am, a grown ceiling watching a chair and grown human making laser noises with their mouths shooting invisible aliens."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/18/c-0/18
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "And I <i>love it.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/18/c-0/32
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Okay, uh... the threat has been neutralized!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/18/c-0/40
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "...lights down! You can get off me now, haha."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/18/c-0/57
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Very enjoyable performance, Chairemi."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/18/c-0/65
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "...though I daresay it looks like you enjoyed it even more than I."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/18/c-0/73
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "H-Haha! I'm sure I don't know what you're talking about!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/18/c-0/81
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Mhm."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/18/c-0/89
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Okay, bye mayor! See you next Tuesday!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success/0/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-0/18/c-0/100
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Phew..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_2/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You throw your arms around Chairemi, pulling her into a warm hug."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_2/0/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "CAPTAIN. WHAT. WHAT IS THIS?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_2/0/19
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "MY CIRCUITS ARE GOING HAYWIRE. THESE READOUTS... I DON'T UNDERSTAND. I AM FILLED WITH A SORT OF... WARM, FUZZY ELECTRICITY."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_2/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's love, Chairbot."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "\"LOVE\"... UNDERSTOOD."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_2/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "CAPTAIN. CAN YOU TEACH ME MORE ABOUT LOVE?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_2/0/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I thought you'd never ask, Chairbot."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_2/0/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You lean your forehead against Chairbot's. For a moment, Chairbot seems to feel something."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_2/0/c-0/26/c-0/29
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aw. That's a sweet story."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_2/0/c-0/26/c-0/40
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "A shame that they forgot about the reactor core, though."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_2/0/c-0/26/c-0/56
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "They're probably moments from death."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_2/0/c-0/26/c-0/72
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "<i>A-hem.</i> Well, I can see you two are preoccupied. I'll leave you to it, then."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_3/0/0/b/4
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "(Well, the human's acting is certainly committed. I'll give him that.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_3/0/3/b/4
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "(Well, the human's acting is certainly committed. I'll give her that.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_3/0/6/b/4
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "(Well, the human's acting is certainly committed. I'll give them that.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_3/0/12
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "AAA! CAPTAIN, PLEASE."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_3/0/20/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "First you... then the rest of the human race!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_3/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "AAA! MY PARTS! MY PARTS ARE BEING ATTACKED!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_3/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "MALFUNCTION. MALFUNCTION. MAL... FUNCT... I... ON..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_3/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "BYOOOOoooo..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_3/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "And with that, Chairbot is dead. ...and Earth's final hour begins in earnest... Lights down."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_3/0/c-0/39
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Wow! Bummer ending, but I kinda liked it!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_4/0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "What are you doing to me, human?! Release me!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_4/0/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Wh-What's this...? What's... happening!?!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_4/0/19
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "It's some sort of... aura! An aura of love! I can feel its power! If we can somehow harness this, we can defeat these invaders! But how could we...?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_4/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Kiss the alien on the cheek.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_4/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You surge forward, pressing your lips to Chairemi's cheek."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_4/0/c-0/12
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "W-Whoa! This power!!! IT'S OVERWHELMING!!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_4/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(The two of us shake and the power of psychic, interspecies connection overwhelms the stage, destroying the invaders and turning them back. The battle is won!)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_4/0/c-0/40
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "...perhaps I misjudged you, human. We can use this power of love..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_4/0/c-0/51
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "For WAR!!! <w>Ahahahahahaha!!!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_4/0/c-0/84
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Well."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_4/0/c-0/92
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "That was more of an... <i>art house</i> performance that I was expecting."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_4/0/c-0/100
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Haha, sorry mayor."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_4/0/c-0/108
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Don't worry, I've seen more than my fair share of <i>avant garde</i> plays in my time."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_4/0/c-0/116
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Normally I would stick around to offer critique... but I feel you two would rather spend the next few minutes alone."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_4/0/c-0/124
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aha... um..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_4/0/c-0/135
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Be seeing you."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_love_success_4/0/c-0/146
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "B-Bye, mayor."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_alien_attack/0/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hi-yah!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_alien_attack/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ow..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/scifi_alien_attack/0/c-0/10
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Oof. Well. That didn't seem rehearsed."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/3
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Woo, yaaay!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/11
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(Florence loves this fantasy stuff. She's a great audience too, very encouraging. You'll do great.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/25
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Today’s play is \"Everblade\". I’ll be playing a forest sprite. You play all who I encounter on my adventure."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/59
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hail, wise wizard! I am Spindle, the sprite."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/67
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "My forest is dying. The flowers wilt and the leaves fall and die in all seasons."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/75
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I beg of you... look into your crystal ball and tell me what I must do to save my home!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/83/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You must seek out the legendary sword, Everblade! Only its power can cleanse your forest."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/84/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "An evil creature is poisoning your home. If they are not defeated, then the forest will die."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "And so, dear viewer, the sprite began her quest to seek the sword Everblade!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/32
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "She traveled far, and on her road faced many dangers, such as..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A nefarious bridge troll!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A spooky lich king!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh my! A bridge troll!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nyeh heh heh! None may pass without first paying... the troll toll!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-0/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Mercy, kind troll. I am but a humble forest sprite. We have no use for money, and so I have nothing with which to pay the toll."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-0/18/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Then you must pay with... your life!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-0/18/c-0/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Then you must pay with... a little dance!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-0/18/c-0/15/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, that's fine. The economy's been pretty rough lately, I totally get it."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/7 chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Very well. If I must."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "The wood sprite leans down and rips off her own leg. She plants it in the ground like a cutting and grows a second wood sprite."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/26
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Here you go. One lifespan."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/37/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Whoa. That's pretty metal."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Nay, 'tis wood."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Am I free to go?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah, I suppose so!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/37/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Wonderful."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "But you should know that I come from a long line of powerful dancers."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-1/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "We have two left feet... but two right feet as well!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-1/31
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Ha ha!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-1/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Agh! Your dance is so powerful that I exploded!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-1/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "As I cut a rug, so too do I cut your lifespan."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-1/39/c-0/18
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Haha, yay!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-2/10
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "(Oof, tell me about it.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-2/21
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Right?! With all these dragons hoarding their wealth, everything is in absolute shambles."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-2/29
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Thank you, friend. This kindness shall not be forgotten!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Zounds! This hallowed graveyard is being desecrated by an undead necromancer."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Ack! No one can know my secret! Prepare to join my legion of the undead! <i>Cast a spell</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-1/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah? So what, spriggan? Ain't no law against necromancy in this province."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Using her knowledge of spellcraft, the spriggan quickly identifies the incoming attack! It's..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-1/15/c-0/26
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(Psst. What are you casting?)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-1/15/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A rapid-aging spell."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-1/15/c-0/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm summoning a skeleton."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-1/15/c-0/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "A spell that rapidly ages everyone in the vicinity! How dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-1/15/c-0/34/c-0/21
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Unfortunately for you, I'm made of living wood."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-1/15/c-0/34/c-0/32
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Woo! Hardwood! Woo!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-1/15/c-0/34/c-0/43
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "In nice, sunny conditions like the ones we have today I can live several hundred years."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-1/15/c-0/34/c-0/51
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Human lifespans aren't nearly as long. Which means..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-1/15/c-0/34/c-0/59/0/s/0 chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_3/0/c-0/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bleh! <i>Die.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-1/15/c-0/34/c-0/59/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Well. That problem resolved itself."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-1/15/c-0/34/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "A skeleton-summoning spell! Of course!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-1/15/c-0/34/c-1/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "The skeleton is summoned!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-1/15/c-0/34/c-1/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Klinka-klinka klink klint. Splat!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-1/15/c-0/34/c-1/31
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Whoops. The skeleton fell apart. That's what happens when you only summon bones with no muscles or connective tissue."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-1/15/c-0/34/c-1/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why do you think I'm robbing these graves in the first place?!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-1/15/c-0/34/c-1/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Well. I'll be going then."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-1/15/c-0/34/c-1/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Have a bad day, fell necromancer."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-1/15/c-0/34/c-1/39/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Blehh!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-1/15/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "That is true."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-1/15/c-1/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh well. 'Tis none of my business!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-0/40/c-1/15/c-1/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "And so the forest sprite bypassed the first obstacle by exercising the most ancient magic of all: \"Staying in her lane\"."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Then my quest is clear, wizard. Just point the way and I will go!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/38
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "(Heehee! I love the way they run in place to make it look like they're moving.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/49
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "After days of travel, I have made it to the fell cave! The poison is coming from here."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/57
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Show yourself, fell beast! I know you are there! I have come to defeat you and save my home!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/65
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(Psst. Be the fell beast!)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I am the Spectral Knight. My spirit longs for its former kingdom that used to stand on this ground... To rebuild it, I must first destroy this forest!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I am the Fell Dragon. My poison seeps into whatever land I touch. I have been cast out from a hundred homes. Would you cast me aside again?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "You can't! So many innocent creatures live in these woods! This is not your home anymore, knight... and I will stand against you."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Very well. Draw your sword! <i>Prepare for battle</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/21/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Very well. Let's see if you can withstand this spell! Summon termites! <i>Tickle her.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I need no sword to fight you, Knight."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/21/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Summon... the spirits of the forest!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/21/c-0/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Bees!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/21/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Agh! Bees! They're swarming me!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/21/c-0/31/c-0/10
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Yes!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/21/c-0/31/c-0/18
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Woodpeckers!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/21/c-0/31/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Agh! Woodpeckers banging against my armor!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/21/c-0/31/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Get 'em! Get 'em!!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/21/c-0/31/c-0/26/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "River spirit!!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/21/c-0/31/c-0/26/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aaaaagh! The river! It's washing me away! I'm rusting away... to... nothing...!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/21/c-0/31/c-0/26/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Yeah!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/21/c-0/31/c-0/26/c-0/23/c-0/18
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I did it! The Knight is defeated!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/21/c-0/31/c-0/26/c-0/23/c-0/26
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "What's this? The blade by its side... It's the Everblade! This is a legendary sword!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/21/c-0/31/c-0/26/c-0/23/c-0/34
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "If I use the magic from this, I should be able to heal the forest! Huzzah! The day is saved!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/21/c-0/31/c-0/26/c-0/23/c-0/67 chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success/0/c-0/40
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Bravo, bravo!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/21/c-0/31/c-0/26/c-0/23/c-0/75 chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success/0/c-0/48
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh, I love a good fantasy story."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/21/c-0/31/c-0/26/c-0/23/c-0/83 chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success/0/c-0/56
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Thanks, Florence. Same time next week?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/21/c-0/31/c-0/26/c-0/23/c-0/91 chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success/0/c-0/64
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Absolutely! See you then!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/21/c-1/8/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You try to tickle Chairemi, but she leaps away from your unwanted touch."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-0/21/c-1/8/b/23
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Poor dragon. You have my pity."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Is there any way for us to end this poisoning?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Would that I could, little sprite. This power is beyond my control. I was cursed hundreds of years ago."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The poison is strong, little sprite. The only thing that could cure it... a kiss from a woodland creature, pure of heart."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "What!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This hated sword sticking out of my back is the source of my misery. The source of your poison."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I know that sword! It is a sword of legend, the Everblade!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Once the blade is stuck in its target, any curse the attacker puts on their victim lasts for all of time!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/c-0/37
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "You must've been cursed years ago. Would you let me pull out the sword, dragon?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/c-0/45/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I would. But any creature that gets close to me will surely die from my poisons."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/c-0/45/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "If I do not get close, my home will surely die, and me with it. My fate is the same regardless."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/c-0/45/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I would gladly give my life to save the land I love."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/c-0/45/c-0/26
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Spindle, no...!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/c-0/45/c-0/37/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Such a noble creature. Very well. Come, then. Try."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/c-0/45/c-0/37/c-0/10
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Spindle, no, you can't!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/c-0/45/c-0/37/c-0/21
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "The curse is lifted... the poison... gone... My home... sa... ved..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/c-0/45/c-0/37/c-0/29/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Poor sprite. You're nearly withered already. You have done me a service beyond words. I will repay you in kind."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/c-0/45/c-0/37/c-0/29/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "...egh..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/c-0/45/c-0/37/c-0/29/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I spear this forest floor with the Everblade. I will make it my life's work to make sure that the denizens of this place will never forget this heroic sacrifice."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/c-0/45/c-0/37/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Thank you, dragon. ...goodbye."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/c-0/45/c-0/37/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/40
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Well? What do you think?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/c-0/45/c-0/37/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/56
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hey now. If it made you sad enough to cry, that means it was good theater, wasn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/c-0/45/c-0/37/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/75
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "I suppose so... But I liked Spindle."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/c-0/45/c-0/37/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/86
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Well, next week I'll be sure to do a happy ending instead. Okay?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/c-0/45/c-0/37/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/94
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "You promise?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/c-0/45/c-0/37/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/102
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Yeah. See you then?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/c-0/45/c-0/37/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/110
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "...alright. Next week then."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-0/21/c-0/45/c-0/37/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/121 chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-1/29/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/86
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Bye, Florence!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-1/8/b/12
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You lean in for a kiss, but Chairemi leaps backward away from you."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-1/8/b/20
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Wait. Why did she dodge the kiss?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play/0/c-1/76/c-1/23/c-1/8/b/28
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "I suppose that's why chemistry is very important in a scene partner."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You tickle Chairemi mercilessly, your fingers running up and down her sides until she doubles over with laughter."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success/0/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hehehehe... hahaha! Oh no! The spell! It's too strong!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success/0/16
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(Haha... I reach my hand down to your s-side and draw the sword from your holster!)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success/0/27
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "B-Begone, specter! H-Hahaha... I slay thee!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success/0/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Agh! The Everblade in my hilt! The only thing... keeping my spirit tied to this plane... without it... I'm... n-nothing... Bleh!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Huzzah! The monster is slain, and with its death, my forest is saved!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_2/0/3
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Aww!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_2/0/14
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "\"Pure of heart\"... I am unsure if I am qualified... but I shall do what I can."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_2/0/25
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Chairemi approaches you, pressing a delicate kiss to your lips."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_2/0/33
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Mwah!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_2/0/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh... your heart, little sprite. It is pure, indeed! I am... transforming!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_2/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Egads! Dragon... you've turned into... a handsome woodland prince!'"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_2/0/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Indeed. And what's more, my body is small enough that the sword fell out of it."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "How convenient!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Come. Let us walk, hand in hand, and watch over the forest together, evermore."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes. ...together."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "\"Evermore\"? Or... Ever<i>blade</i>?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Bahahaha! Shut up! Agh, you made me break character right at the end!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Dork."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-1/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Cute dork."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-1/48
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "I think it's time we were on our way, Florence."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-1/56
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Ah!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-1/64
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I'm so sorry. I totally forgot you two were there!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-1/75
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Obviously."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-1/83
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Let's go."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-1/91
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Ooh, have fun you too! Ho ho ho!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_2/0/c-0/15/c-0/23/c-1/105
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Aw, man..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "And so, the little wood sprite continued on her adventure."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/11
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Finally, after many days and nights, she came to the resting place of the fabled Everblade."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/19
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "There, atop a mountain of discarded swords from days gone by, sat the dreaded Sword Lord: A terrifying warrior clad from toe to tip in rusted metal hilts and blades."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/27
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Once a sword entered his collection, he would do anything to keep it. This would be tricky."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/35
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hail, Sword Lord!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/46
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I am but a humble sprite, hailing from the forests far to the west. My home is doomed unless I have the power of the Everblade at my side!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/54
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "So, I beseech you..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/62
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Can you, like, be cool about this?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/70/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nay! <i>Fight to the death!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/71/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah alright."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-0/8/b/1
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You leap at Chairemi, intent on skewering her with your imaginary sword, but she just leaps out of the way, sending you tumbling to the floor. It's quite embarrassing."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-0/8/b/20
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "H-Huh?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-0/8/b/28
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Wait... why did the human fall over?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh! Truly?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-1/21
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "My heart is filled with joy."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-1/29/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "...on one condition."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-1/29/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Name your price, oh Lord of Bloodshed and Tetanus."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-1/29/c-0/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "After several hundred years, my body has grown weak. Dull and rusted, like these many swords. I have been looking for... a successor."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-1/29/c-0/18/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "A successor! You jest! Surely a simple wood sprite could never live up to your legend."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-1/29/c-0/18/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aye... that's what I thought, once. Before I took up the mantle of Sword Lord myself. <i>Remove your helmet for a dramatic reveal</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-1/29/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/10
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "<i>Gasp!</i> No way!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-1/29/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/21
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "You're... a wood sprite?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-1/29/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/29/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "As was my successor before me, and the Sword Lord before them."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-1/29/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/29/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "It cannot be!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-1/29/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/29/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Who better to take the swords of man and sequester them away than we wood sprites, who have seen mankind's blades cut down so many of our kin?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-1/29/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "And now you want me to take up the mantle?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-1/29/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "The Everblade is yours... so long as you take my name with it."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-1/29/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "...I see."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-1/29/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Very well. It shall be done. I shall become the Sword Lord, and with this power, defend my forest from all those who would seek to see it leveled to the ground."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-1/29/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/43
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh, GREAT twist! I never would've expected it!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-1/29/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/51
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Yeah. I'd definitely watch a sequel about that wood sprite going ham on some lumberjacks."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-1/29/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/59
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Well, I don't know about all that."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-1/29/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/67
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "But either way, I. LOVED it."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/friday_play_finale/0/c-1/29/c-0/18/c-0/15/c-0/29/c-0/15/c-0/15/c-0/75
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Thanks for the show! I'll be back next week!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_3/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You give Chairemi a good stage fight, jabbing at her with your invisible blades. She dodges, giving as good as she gets."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_3/0/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hiya!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_3/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hiya!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_3/0/c-0/10
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Go, Spindle, you can do it!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_3/0/c-0/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Alas... I am... victorious."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_3/0/c-0/21/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "The Everblade is mine, and with it my home is saved!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_3/0/c-0/21/c-0/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "But am I... saved? This journey. The things I have seen. They have changed me forever, much like the author who originally penned this work after returning home from the war."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_3/0/c-0/21/c-0/31
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "So bittersweet. So sad."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_3/0/c-0/21/c-0/39
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Lights... down."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_3/0/c-0/21/c-0/56
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Yaaay!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_3/0/c-0/21/c-0/67
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Florence. Didn't you hear the last line? This ending is supposed to be bittersweet."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_3/0/c-0/21/c-0/75
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh, to be honest, I've never really understood all that \"subtext\" stuff!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_3/0/c-0/21/c-0/83
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "I'm a floor! I only get what's at surface level!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_3/0/c-0/21/c-0/91
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "And what's at surface level is cool swords and cool battles!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_3/0/c-0/21/c-0/99
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Haha, well, so long as you enjoyed it."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/everblade_love_success_3/0/c-0/21/c-0/107
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Thank you for the lovely time, you two! Toodles!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive/3 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy/3
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Davenport!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive/17
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Sorry. You seem nice, but... well..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive/25
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "The thing is, I don't actually know you that well. I'm not comfortable with that level of physical contact yet."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive/33
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Maybe we should call it for the day. I'm actually feeling a little beat."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive/41/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Sorry, Florence. I know this one's your favorite."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive/41/b/12
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh, no, no. That's completely alright. Don't mind me. We all have our off days."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive/41/b/20
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "I'll be here next week, same time, same place."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive/41/b/31 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy/60/b/39
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Thanks. See ya."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive/42/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Sorry, mayor. I know this is like, the one time you take a break."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive/42/b/12
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "I'll be fine, dear."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive/42/b/20 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy/61/b/20
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Just be sure you rest up so you're ready to impress me next time around, hmm?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive/42/b/31 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive/43/b/45 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy/61/b/31 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy/62/b/45
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Haha, yeah, sure thing."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive/43/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Sorry you two. I know this is your big outing for the week. I hate to cut it short, but..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive/43/b/15 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy/62/b/15
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh, no no no! Don't worry about us!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive/43/b/23 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy/62/b/23
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Yes, the important thing is that you're comfortable, darling."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive/43/b/31 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy/62/b/31
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Just be sure you rest up so you're ready to impress us next week, hmm?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy/17
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Whoa. Um."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy/25
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy/33
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Sorry. That's too much for me."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy/41
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Even if you're \"in-character\", it just doesn't feel right. We just met, y'know!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy/52
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "...maybe we should call it for the day. I'm kinda tired, actually."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy/60/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I-If that's okay with you, Florence!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy/60/b/9
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Sorry, I know you're a fan of these."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy/60/b/20
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "What? Oh, no, don't even worry about me, dearie. Just... take the rest of the day off!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy/60/b/28
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "I need to catch up on some paperwork for the mayor anyways. But I'll be here next week, same time, same place!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy/61/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Er... if that's alright with you, Miss Mayor?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy/61/b/12
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "Of course. I'm not going to <i>force</i> you to perform after... <i>That.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy/62/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Er... if that's okay with you two! I know this is your big outing for the week. I hate to cut it short, but..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive_again/3 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy_again/0/3
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Whoa, Davenport! Davenport!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive_again/14
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "What's up? I warned you before, didn't I?! You need to keep your scene partner's boundaries in mind! You can't just... come out swinging all of a sudden! Jeez!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive_again/25
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Y'know what? I'm not sure if I can do this anymore."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive_again/33
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I don't think I feel comfortable with this. There's just no warning with you!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive_again/41
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I'm gonna perform by myself from now on."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive_again/49/b/1 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy_again/0/g-0/8/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Sorry, Florence. I think the show's over for today."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive_again/49/b/12 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy_again/0/g-0/8/b/12
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh, don't worry about that."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive_again/49/b/20 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy_again/0/g-0/8/b/20
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "(Are you alright? Want me to make you some tea?)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive_again/49/b/28
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(Hah, yeah... I think that'd be good.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive_again/49/b/36 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy_again/0/g-0/8/b/36
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Poor thing..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive_again/50/b/1 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy_again/0/g-0/9/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I'm sorry, Miss Mayor. I think I have to end the show early today."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive_again/50/b/12 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy_again/0/g-0/9/b/12
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "I completely understand."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive_again/50/b/20 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy_again/0/g-0/9/b/20
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "I'll be looking forward to the next performance even more."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive_again/50/b/28 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive_again/51/b/31 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy_again/0/g-0/9/b/28 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy_again/0/g-0/10/b/31
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Thanks..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive_again/50/b/36 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy_again/0/g-0/9/b/36
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "(And, in the meantime... Let me know if they give you any more... trouble. I'll be sure to give them a stern talking-to.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive_again/51/b/1 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy_again/0/g-0/10/b/1
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Sorry, guys. I think the show's over for today."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive_again/51/b/15 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy_again/0/g-0/10/b/15
msgctxt "Florence"
msgid "Oh! You don't have to worry about us!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive_again/51/b/23 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy_again/0/g-0/10/b/23
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "It's just a show, darling. This simply means I'll be looking forward to your next performance all the more."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive_again/51/b/39 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy_again/0/g-0/10/b/39
msgctxt "Celia"
msgid "(And, in the meantime... Let me know if they give you any more... trouble. I'll be sure to give them a stern talking-to.)."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive_again/88 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy_again/0/g-0/47
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Gonna sit this one out?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_aggressive_again/96 chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy_again/0/g-0/55
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Honestly I think she was just a <i>chair</i> out of your league."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy_again/0/20
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "What are you doing?! Eugh!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy_again/0/31
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I warned you once already, didn't I?! You need to keep your scene partner's boundaries in mind!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy_again/0/42
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I'm not comfortable with you... slobbering all over me like that. I'm your co-star, not a prop you can just use however you want!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy_again/0/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But slobbering is my way of showing I love you!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy_again/0/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy_again/0/52/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You just don't understand my artistic methods."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy_again/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Y'know what? I'm sorry, but I don't think I want to perform with you anymore. I can't focus on the scene if I have to worry about you... making a move on me, or whatever."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_failure_creepy_again/0/g-0/8/b/28
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "(Haha, yeah, I think that'd be good.)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_hatereturn/0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "...this is a closed rehearsal. You have to go."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_hatereturn/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Exit.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_hatereturn/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I wanted to apologize for last time. (USE CHARM CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_hatereturn/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_hatereturn/0/c-1/21
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Well, you do seem less... woogidy-woo right now."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_hatereturn/0/c-1/29
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Look, I appreciate you taking the time to reflect and talk to me about this, but... I take this sort of thing really seriously."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_hatereturn/0/c-1/37
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I like to think I'm a pretty open scene partner. There's a lot I can roll with, but once someone crosses my line, they can't un-cross it, y'know?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_hatereturn/0/c-1/45
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I really have to put my foot down on that sort of thing. All four of them."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_hatereturn/0/c-1/53/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's okay. I don't need to perform with you, I just wanted to apologize."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_hatereturn/0/c-1/53/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_hatereturn/0/c-1/53/c-0/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Well. That's... Okay, that's alright then."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_hatereturn/0/c-1/53/c-0/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "We can be friends?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_hatereturn/0/c-1/53/c-0/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Friends."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_hatereturn/0/c-1/53/c-0/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_hatereturn/0/c-1/53/c-0/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Glad we talked this out. I was worried for a second when you came over that I might have to sicc my personal bouncer on you."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_hatereturn/0/c-1/53/c-0/31/c-0/18
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "And it might not look it, but Miss Celia has a mean right hook."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_hatereturn/0/c-1/53/c-0/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "What? Why would you pick that? You are <i>SO</i>weird."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_hatereturn/0/c-1/53/c-0/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Get out of here, creep."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_friendshipreturn/0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Heya, partner! How's it going?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_friendshipreturn/0/8/s/0 chairemi_chair/chair_lovereturn/0/13/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you doing any plays?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_friendshipreturn/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Later, skater."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_friendshipreturn/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey Chairemi! Just wanted a high-five from the coolest actor around!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_friendshipreturn/0/11/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Actually, I'm ready to Realize you."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_friendshipreturn/0/c-0/7 chairemi_chair/chair_lovereturn/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Not at the moment! Actually the off-season just started."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_friendshipreturn/0/c-0/15 chairemi_chair/chair_lovereturn/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Gotta pick up some part-time jobs. The plays are fun, but not super profitable! It's ok if chairs fold, but we wouldn't want the theater to, y'know?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_friendshipreturn/0/c-0/23 chairemi_chair/chair_lovereturn/0/c-1/23
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Plus, if I get enough jobs, I can afford... <i>health insurance!</i>!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_friendshipreturn/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Chairemi gives you a big friendly hug - and gets back to her job searching."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_friendshipreturn/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "You got it!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_lovereturn/0/4
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh! Hey lover! How's it going?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_lovereturn/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Sit on Chairemi.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_lovereturn/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll see you around, darling."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_lovereturn/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've been thinking that I want to Realize you!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_lovereturn/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's all she ever wanted."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chair_lovereturn/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Come by anytime... Except of course for during the day and night when I'm working."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "You mean turn me human?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realize_join/0/8
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Gosh I dunno. I'd halve my chances when auditioning for the kicking."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realize_join/0/16
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Only two legs!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realize_join/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Even with just two legs you're still a knockout."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realize_join/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good point. Plus I don't have the stats yet anyway."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realize_join/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "You're such a goober."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "What's up goob!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realize_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realize_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Goob?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realize_return/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Goob! I called you goober last time."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realize_return/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's great Chairemi. Anyway. I'm ready to make you a human."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realize_return/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Guess I'm still goobin' it up. Still don't have the stats."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realize_return/0/g-0/c-3/10
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Get it together, goob!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realize_begin/6/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Starting with Chairemi, huh? The curtain rises... here's hoping it works!!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realize_begin/9
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Okay Chairemi, break a leg! Or at least, enjoy walking on two of them!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realize_begin/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a chair, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realized/0/3
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Wow... my newest role: A human being!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realized/0/11
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Hang on, let me get into character. *Ahem*..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realized/0/19
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "\"Hey everybody! I'm a human! I need to do my taxes!\""
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realized/0/27
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "\"I'm going to bang my foot into the chair, and then blame her for it, even though she can't move and I put her there!\""
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realized/0/35
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "\"I spent seven hours today doomscrolling on my phone! Why do I have anxiety???\""
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realized/0/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Y'know what else humans can do? <i>Sweep her off her feet.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realized/0/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bro. Bro. That is <i>dead on.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realized/0/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Look up from your phone</i> Huh?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realized/0/c-0/10
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You sweep Chairemi up into your arms in a bridal carry."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realized/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "W-Whoa! Haha!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realized/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Oh my gosh, the middle of me, like, <i>bends</i> now! I'm so easy to hold!"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realized/0/c-0/34
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "I wonder what else I can do..."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realized/0/c-0/42
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "You wanna show me?"
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realized/0/c-0/53
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "With a nod, you and Chairemi dance your way to the bedroom."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realized/0/c-0/61
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Unsurprisingly, Chairemi immediately takes to the concept of roleplay."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realized/0/c-0/69
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It takes a few characters worth of foreplay to find the groove, but once you both get into character you have an incredible time, laughing and joking your way into the sheets, falling in and out of giggly make-out sessions."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realized/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Chairemi"
msgid "Haha, see? I'm nailing this \"human thing\" already."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realized/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Chairemi spends the next few hours improvising little skits with you, exploring all the new ways her human body can dance and bend and sing."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realized/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Her energy seems never-ending, and you tire long before she does."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realized/0/g-0/24/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Eventually, Chairemi leaves the nest and seeks a job and a home of her own."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realized/0/g-0/24/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You see her here and there around town, always working odd jobs with a smile on her face. A waitress here, a grocery bagger there. It's always a nice surprise."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realized/0/g-0/24/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Perhaps her favorite appears to be reading stories aloud to little kids at the library."
msgstr ""

#: chairemi_chair/chairemi_realized/0/g-0/24/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "She does the voices. The kids love it when she does the voices."
msgstr ""
